            ['start_time' => 262.174, 'end_time' => 265.394, 'target_text' => 'suddenly you you are faced with the gravel.', 'source_text' => 'secara tiba-tiba anda berhadapan dengan jalan berbatu kerikil.', 'order' => 100],
            ['start_time' => 265.494, 'end_time' => 273.554, 'target_text' => 'You remember me and you say one day we were told at the CTICC that you don\'t apply brakes and you don\'t slam the brakes', 'source_text' => 'Anda teringat kepada saya dan berkata suatu hari dahulu kita pernah diberitahu di CTICC bahawa jangan menekan brek kecemasan', 'order' => 101],
            ['start_time' => 273.654, 'end_time' => 276.704, 'target_text' => 'when you\'re on gravel or sand, right?', 'source_text' => 'apabila anda berada di atas jalan berbatu kerikil atau pasir, betul bukan?', 'order' => 102],
            ['start_time' => 276.804, 'end_time' => 281.354, 'target_text' => 'And then suddenly you navigated with a smile and you came out of it and you\'re thinking, "Gosh, you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan kemudian tiba-tiba anda berjaya melaluinya dengan senyuman dan melepasi laluan itu lalu berfikir, "Wah, alhamdulillah!', 'order' => 103],
            ['start_time' => 281.454, 'end_time' => 282.154, 'target_text' => 'We were told.', 'source_text' => 'Kita telah pun diingatkan.', 'order' => 104],
            ['start_time' => 282.254, 'end_time' => 284.514, 'target_text' => 'I did I I I glided straight through it.', 'source_text' => 'Saya meluncur terus melepasinya dengan selamat.', 'order' => 105],
            ['start_time' => 284.614, 'end_time' => 292.294, 'target_text' => 'It\'s gone." And suddenly there is another strip of gravel or sand.', 'source_text' => 'Ia telah pun berlalu." Namun tiba-tiba ada satu lagi laluan berbatu kerikil atau berpasir di hadapan.', 'order' => 106],
            ['start_time' => 292.444, 'end_time' => 294.354, 'target_text' => 'Now, you don\'t lose patience.', 'source_text' => 'Sekarang, janganlah anda hilang kesabaran.', 'order' => 107],
            ['start_time' => 294.454, 'end_time' => 295.474, 'target_text' => 'You have to do the drill.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu mengulangi langkah tindakan yang sama.', 'order' => 108],
            ['start_time' => 295.574, 'end_time' => 296.904, 'target_text' => 'Do you know the drill?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda tahu langkah tindakannya?', 'order' => 109],
            ['start_time' => 297.004, 'end_time' => 298.514, 'target_text' => 'We just talked about it, right?', 'source_text' => 'Kita baru sahaja membincangkannya tadi, bukan?', 'order' => 110],
            ['start_time' => 298.614, 'end_time' => 299.984, 'target_text' => 'You did it again.', 'source_text' => 'Anda melakukannya sekali lagi.', 'order' => 111],
            ['start_time' => 300.084, 'end_time' => 302.624, 'target_text' => 'After some time there\'s a third one.', 'source_text' => 'Selepas beberapa ketika, muncul pula laluan yang ketiga.', 'order' => 112],
            ['start_time' => 302.724, 'end_time' => 304.304, 'target_text' => 'You do it again.', 'source_text' => 'Anda lakukannya sekali lagi.', 'order' => 113],
            ['start_time' => 304.404, 'end_time' => 309.554, 'target_text' => 'Ah, you do it as many times as you have to because if you don\'t do it even once, that\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Ah, anda lakukannya seberapa banyak kali yang diperlukan kerana jika anda terlepas walau sekali sahaja, akibatnya amat buruk.', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 309.654, 'end_time' => 310.664, 'target_text' => 'You could injure yourself.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh mengalami kecederaan.', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 310.764, 'end_time' => 311.394, 'target_text' => 'You could die.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh kehilangan nyawa.', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 311.494, 'end_time' => 313.834, 'target_text' => 'You could put others\' lives at risk.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh membahayakan nyawa orang lain.', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 313.934, 'end_time' => 317.554, 'target_text' => 'I give you another example, a good example from South Africa.', 'source_text' => 'Saya beri satu lagi contoh yang baik dari Afrika Selatan.', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 317.654, 'end_time' => 319.554, 'target_text' => 'We love safari, right?', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua suka aktiviti safari, bukan?', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 319.654, 'end_time' => 323.634, 'target_text' => 'People come and say, "Safari?" And we\'re like, "Ah, in backyard." Do you guys have lions?', 'source_text' => 'Orang datang dan bertanya, "Ada safari ke?" Dan kita berseloroh, "Ah, di halaman belakang rumah je." Adakah anda mempunyai singa?', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 323.734, 'end_time' => 328.314, 'target_text' => 'We always lie and we say, "Yeah, yeah, right in backyard." They say, "There are a few elephants here and there." And we\'re', 'source_text' => 'Kita selalu bergurau dan berkata, "Ya, ya, ada di belakang rumah." Mereka kata, "Ada beberapa ekor gajah di sana sini." Dan sebenarnya kita', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 328.414, 'end_time' => 330.234, 'target_text' => 'referring to big people, right?', 'source_text' => 'merujuk kepada orang yang berbadan besar, kan?', 'order' => 122],
            ['start_time' => 330.334, 'end_time' => 330.984, 'target_text' => 'A few elephants.', 'source_text' => 'Beberapa ekor gajah.', 'order' => 123],
            ['start_time' => 331.084, 'end_time' => 331.484, 'target_text' => 'Astaghfirullah.', 'source_text' => 'Astaghfirullah.', 'order' => 124],
            ['start_time' => 331.574, 'end_time' => 335.114, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t ever refer to a person as a buffalo.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan sesekali menyamakan manusia dengan kerbau liar.', 'order' => 125],
            ['start_time' => 335.214, 'end_time' => 337.824, 'target_text' => 'They\'re not part of the big five, by the way.', 'source_text' => 'Lagipun mereka bukan sebahagian daripada lima haiwan utama (Big Five).', 'order' => 126],
            ['start_time' => 337.924, 'end_time' => 339.234, 'target_text' => 'So, I tell you what.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, biar saya kongsikan sesuatu.', 'order' => 127],
            ['start_time' => 339.334, 'end_time' => 343.794, 'target_text' => 'You see in your safari vehicle there no windows.', 'source_text' => 'Anda lihat di dalam kenderaan safari anda, ia tiada cermin tingkap.', 'order' => 128],
            ['start_time' => 343.894, 'end_time' => 344.474, 'target_text' => 'It\'s open.', 'source_text' => 'Ia terbuka luas.', 'order' => 129],
            ['start_time' => 344.574, 'end_time' => 346.394, 'target_text' => 'And you wonder there\'s lions, there\'s everything.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda tertanya-tanya, di sana ada singa, ada pelbagai pemangsa.', 'order' => 130],
            ['start_time' => 346.494, 'end_time' => 347.394, 'target_text' => 'They tell you, "Don\'t worry.', 'source_text' => 'Pemandu arah memberitahu anda, "Jangan risau.', 'order' => 131],
            ['start_time' => 347.494, 'end_time' => 350.554, 'target_text' => 'A lion sees this car as one big animal." I don\'t know, I was told that.', 'source_text' => 'Singa melihat kereta ini sebagai satu makhluk haiwan yang sangat besar." Saya tidak pasti, itu yang diberitahu kepada saya.', 'order' => 132],
            ['start_time' => 350.654, 'end_time' => 352.064, 'target_text' => 'Is it right?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah ia benar?', 'order' => 133],
            ['start_time' => 352.164, 'end_time' => 356.704, 'target_text' => 'The minute you stick your hand out, it\'s like one animal and a hand.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaik sahaja anda menghulurkan tangan anda keluar, ia kelihatan seperti seekor haiwan besar yang ada tangan terkeluar.', 'order' => 134],
            ['start_time' => 356.804, 'end_time' => 358.034, 'target_text' => 'They tell you this, right?', 'source_text' => 'Mereka berpesan begini kepada anda, betul?', 'order' => 135],
            ['start_time' => 358.134, 'end_time' => 360.574, 'target_text' => 'So, do not', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, jangan sesekali', 'order' => 136],
            ['start_time' => 360.724, 'end_time' => 363.904, 'target_text' => 'follow your desires, one\'s fantasies, what you think, "Hey, it\'s an animal.', 'source_text' => 'mengikut hawa nafsu atau khayalan sendiri dengan berfikir, "Alah, ia cuma seekor haiwan.', 'order' => 137],
            ['start_time' => 364.004, 'end_time' => 369.475, 'target_text' => 'It\'s okay." No, wallahi to be very fair and honest, follow the rule.', 'source_text' => 'Tak mengapa." Tidak, demi Allah, secara jujur dan adil, patuhilah peraturan.', 'order' => 138],
            ['start_time' => 369.575, 'end_time' => 371.395, 'target_text' => 'And if you follow the rule, GUESS WHAT HAPPENS?', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya anda mematuhi peraturan, TEKA APA YANG BERLAKU?', 'order' => 139],
            ['start_time' => 371.495, 'end_time' => 373.075, 'target_text' => 'YOU GOT TO FOLLOW THE RULE AGAIN AND AGAIN.', 'source_text' => 'ANDA PERLU MEMATUHI PERATURAN ITU BERULANG-ULANG KALI.', 'order' => 140],
            ['start_time' => 373.175, 'end_time' => 377.785, 'target_text' => 'How many have unsuspectingly been nabbed and nailed?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai orang yang leka akhirnya diserang dan diterkam pemangsa?', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 377.885, 'end_time' => 379.585, 'target_text' => 'And they\'ve lost their lives.', 'source_text' => 'Dan akhirnya mereka kehilangan nyawa.', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 379.685, 'end_time' => 384.625, 'target_text' => 'They say there was a guy in Zimbabwe, true story, in the early \'80s.', 'source_text' => 'Kisah ini berlaku kepada seorang lelaki di Zimbabwe, sebuah kisah benar pada awal tahun 80-an.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 384.725, 'end_time' => 392.595, 'target_text' => 'Every day he used to pass by the lion park and sees a large chunk of beef or meat thrown to the lions.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap hari dia melalui taman singa dan melihat seketul besar daging lembu dilemparkan kepada singa-singa itu.', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 392.695, 'end_time' => 395.715, 'target_text' => 'And the lions are sitting there, you know how they are, lazy.', 'source_text' => 'Dan singa-singa itu sedang duduk berehat di situ, anda tahu bagaimana sifat mereka, kelihatan malas.', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 395.815, 'end_time' => 402.635, 'target_text' => 'I remember when we walked with the lions in Victoria Falls, they told us as we\'re walking, "Don\'t worry, these lions are', 'source_text' => 'Saya teringat sewaktu kami berjalan bersama singa di Air Terjun Victoria, mereka berpesan kepada kami sewaktu berjalan, "Jangan bimbang, singa-singa ini', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 402.735, 'end_time' => 408.075, 'target_text' => 'less than 3 years old." And when the lions are less than three, you can train them a little bit more.', 'source_text' => 'berumur kurang daripada 3 tahun." Dan apabila singa berumur bawah 3 tahun, anda masih boleh melatihnya sedikit.', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 408.175, 'end_time' => 410.755, 'target_text' => 'The minute they over three, don\'t trust a lion.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaik sahaja umurnya melebihi 3 tahun, jangan sesekali mempercayai seekor singa.', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 410.855, 'end_time' => 412.635, 'target_text' => 'Do not trust a lion over three.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan percaya singa yang berusia lebih 3 tahun.', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 412.735, 'end_time' => 413.675, 'target_text' => 'It can do anything.', 'source_text' => 'Ia boleh bertindak di luar jangkaan pada bila-bila masa.', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 413.775, 'end_time' => 417.355, 'target_text' => 'It can have a sudden I call it a psychosis.', 'source_text' => 'Ia boleh mengalami gangguan psikotik secara tiba-tiba.', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 417.455, 'end_time' => 422.155, 'target_text' => 'Suddenly, boom, and you don\'t recognize this lion, but you knew it all along.', 'source_text' => 'Tiba-tiba sahaja ia menerkam, dan anda tidak lagi mengenali singa ini walaupun anda rasa anda mengenalinya selama ini.', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 422.255, 'end_time' => 425.475, 'target_text' => 'Below three, so these lions were 1 and 1/2 years old, big lions.', 'source_text' => 'Di bawah tiga tahun—singa-singa tadi berumur setahun setengah, singa yang sudah agak besar.', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 425.575, 'end_time' => 429.345, 'target_text' => 'The lesson is about being steadfast', 'source_text' => 'Pengajarannya di sini adalah tentang beristiqamah dan teguh bersabar', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 429.445, 'end_time' => 431.975, 'target_text' => 'at times of hardship.', 'source_text' => 'pada waktu-waktu menghadapi ujian kesulitan.', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 432.365, 'end_time' => 433.625, 'target_text' => 'Follow the rule.', 'source_text' => 'Patuhi dan ikutilah peraturan Allah.', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 433.725, 'end_time' => 436.945, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Hardship will come."', 'source_text' => 'Allah menegaskan, "Ujian kesusahan pasti akan tiba."', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 437.045, 'end_time' => 438.595, 'target_text' => 'That gravel will come.', 'source_text' => 'Jalan berbatu kerikil itu pasti akan datang.', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 438.695, 'end_time' => 440.075, 'target_text' => 'The sand will come.', 'source_text' => 'Laluan berpasir itu pasti akan muncul.', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 440.175, 'end_time' => 440.795, 'target_text' => 'Follow the rule.', 'source_text' => 'Patuhi peraturannya.', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 440.895, 'end_time' => 442.035, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t apply brakes.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan tekan brek kecemasan sembarangan.', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 442.135, 'end_time' => 443.395, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t do the wrong things.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan lakukan perkara-perkara yang salah dan dilarang.', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 443.495, 'end_time' => 446.775, 'target_text' => 'Well, hardship has to come to you.', 'source_text' => 'Ujian kesusahan memang ditakdirkan untuk menimpa diri anda.', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 488.765, 'end_time' => 489.875, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 489.975, 'end_time' => 492.437, 'target_text' => 'Allah telling you beautiful verse of the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Allah memberitahu anda melalui ayat Al-Quran yang sangat indah.', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 492.537, 'end_time' => 494.957, 'target_text' => 'You will be tested one after the other.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti akan diuji satu demi satu ujian.', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 495.057, 'end_time' => 499.117, 'target_text' => 'Some, you know, a little bit of fear, anxiety, whatever you want to call it.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagiannya dengan sedikit rasa takut, rasa cemas, atau apa jua gelaran yang anda ingin berikan.', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 499.217, 'end_time' => 505.067, 'target_text' => 'You will be tested with loss of life, loss of produce, with hunger, with so much more.', 'source_text' => 'Anda akan diuji dengan kehilangan jiwa raga, kehilangan hasil tanaman, kebuluran, dan pelbagai ujian lagi.', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 505.167, 'end_time' => 506.787, 'target_text' => 'Give good news to those who are patient.', 'source_text' => 'Berikanlah khabar gembira kepada orang-orang yang bersabar.', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 506.887, 'end_time' => 508.797, 'target_text' => 'When do I be patient?', 'source_text' => 'Bilakah masanya saya perlu bersabar?', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 508.897, 'end_time' => 512.357, 'target_text' => 'Every time it happens, you know the drill.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap kali ujian itu berlaku, anda sudah tahu langkah tindakannya.', 'order' => 171],
            ['start_time' => 512.457, 'end_time' => 514.027, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what I said earlier.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah yang saya sebutkan tadi.', 'order' => 172],
            ['start_time' => 514.127, 'end_time' => 515.557, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t even miss it once.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak boleh mengabaikannya walau sekali pun.', 'order' => 173],
            ['start_time' => 515.657, 'end_time' => 516.197, 'target_text' => 'Try.', 'source_text' => 'Berusahalah sedaya upaya.', 'order' => 174],
            ['start_time' => 516.297, 'end_time' => 517.517, 'target_text' => 'I know we\'re human.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tahu kita hanyalah insan biasa.', 'order' => 175],
            ['start_time' => 517.617, 'end_time' => 518.677, 'target_text' => 'We will cry.', 'source_text' => 'Kita pasti akan menangis.', 'order' => 176],
            ['start_time' => 518.777, 'end_time' => 519.867, 'target_text' => 'We may falter.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mungkin tersungkur goyah.', 'order' => 177],
            ['start_time' => 519.967, 'end_time' => 520.997, 'target_text' => 'Have good company.', 'source_text' => 'Pilihlah sahabat dan persekitaran yang baik.', 'order' => 178],
            ['start_time' => 521.097, 'end_time' => 527.197, 'target_text' => 'Stay in the companionship of the scholars and those with knowledge and those who remember Allah often and remember to send', 'source_text' => 'Dampingilah para ulama dan orang-orang berilmu serta mereka yang sentiasa mengingati Allah, dan lazimilah mengirimkan', 'order' => 179],
            ['start_time' => 527.297, 'end_time' => 533.757, 'target_text' => 'your salawat upon the Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam because that itself will help you in terms of easing your hardship', 'source_text' => 'selawat ke atas Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam kerana selawat itu sendiri akan membantu memudahkan urusan dan meringankan', 'order' => 180],
            ['start_time' => 533.857, 'end_time' => 535.777, 'target_text' => 'and difficulty.', 'source_text' => 'segala kesukaran anda.', 'order' => 181],
            ['start_time' => 536.007, 'end_time' => 539.867, 'target_text' => 'And remember to turn to Allah with two units of prayer and cry to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ingatlah untuk kembali kepada Allah dengan menunaikan dua rakaat solat sunat serta menangis mengadu kepada Allah.', 'order' => 182],
            ['start_time' => 539.967, 'end_time' => 541.317, 'target_text' => 'Remember your adkhar.', 'source_text' => 'Ingatlah zikir dan wirid harian anda.', 'order' => 183],
            ['start_time' => 541.417, 'end_time' => 544.717, 'target_text' => 'Remember to sit with the adkhar on a regular basis.', 'source_text' => 'Ingatlah untuk meluangkan masa berzikir secara istiqamah dan berterusan.', 'order' => 184],
            ['start_time' => 544.817, 'end_time' => 546.517, 'target_text' => 'Many of us are guilty.', 'source_text' => 'Ramai antara kita yang terleka dan bersalah dalam hal ini.', 'order' => 185],
            ['start_time' => 546.617, 'end_time' => 548.707, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t remember Allah enough.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak cukup mengingati dan berzikir kepada Allah.', 'order' => 186],
            ['start_time' => 548.807, 'end_time' => 551.267, 'target_text' => 'And then we want ease in our hardship.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kemudian kita menuntut kemudahan dalam menghadapi kesukaran.', 'order' => 187],
            ['start_time' => 551.367, 'end_time' => 553.517, 'target_text' => 'And then sometimes we lose hope.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kadangkala kita mula berputus asa.', 'order' => 188],
            ['start_time' => 553.617, 'end_time' => 554.517, 'target_text' => 'How can you lose hope?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah anda boleh berputus asa daripada rahmat Allah?', 'order' => 189],
            ['start_time' => 554.617, 'end_time' => 556.237, 'target_text' => 'Remain steadfast.', 'source_text' => 'Kekallah teguh dan beristiqamah.', 'order' => 190],
            ['start_time' => 556.337, 'end_time' => 557.117, 'target_text' => 'Yes, you\'re a human.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, anda hanyalah seorang manusia.', 'order' => 191],
            ['start_time' => 557.217, 'end_time' => 559.637, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why you begin to question.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah fikiran anda mula mempersoalkan pelbagai perkara.', 'order' => 192],
            ['start_time' => 559.737, 'end_time' => 565.877, 'target_text' => 'But don\'t allow the question to make you distance yourself from Allah or questioning Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun jangan biarkan persoalan itu membuatkan anda menjauhkan diri daripada Allah atau meragui ketetapan Allah.', 'order' => 193],
            ['start_time' => 565.977, 'end_time' => 566.637, 'target_text' => 'There is a difference.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat perbezaan yang amat ketara di sini.', 'order' => 194],
            ['start_time' => 566.737, 'end_time' => 574.317, 'target_text' => 'If I say, "Why did Allah do this to me?" Am I asking because I don\'t believe in Allah or I don\'t trust Allah or am I asking', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya bertanya, "Mengapakah Allah mentakdirkan perkara ini kepada saya?" Adakah saya bertanya kerana tidak beriman kepada Allah atau tidak mempercayai Allah, atau adakah saya bertanya', 'order' => 195],
            ['start_time' => 574.417, 'end_time' => 576.357, 'target_text' => 'because I just want to have a bit more knowledge.', 'source_text' => 'semata-mata kerana saya ingin menimba lebih kefahaman dan ilmu?', 'order' => 196],
            ['start_time' => 576.457, 'end_time' => 578.277, 'target_text' => 'I want to try to understand.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin berusaha memahaminya dengan lebih mendalam.', 'order' => 197],
            ['start_time' => 578.377, 'end_time' => 581.357, 'target_text' => 'If you just want to understand, it\'s not wrong to ask the question.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda hanya ingin memahami hikmahnya, tidak salah untuk bertanya soalan tersebut.', 'order' => 198],
            ['start_time' => 581.457, 'end_time' => 586.237, 'target_text' => 'But if you are asking because you don\'t trust Allah, you have a problem in faith.', 'source_text' => 'Namun sekiranya anda bertanya kerana meragui dan tidak mempercayai Allah, maka anda mempunyai masalah besar dalam keimanan anda.', 'order' => 199],
            ['start_time' => 586.337, 'end_time' => 589.547, 'target_text' => 'Then how do you expect to come out of your problem and issue?', 'source_text' => 'Jika demikian, bagaimanakah anda mengharapkan dapat keluar daripada masalah dan kemelut yang sedang anda hadapi?', 'order' => 200],
            ['start_time' => 589.647, 'end_time' => 594.117, 'target_text' => 'So this is why we say, "We know the rules when we are in safaris.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah kita katakan, "Kita tahu peraturannya apabila kita berada dalam aktiviti safari.', 'order' => 201],
            ['start_time' => 594.217, 'end_time' => 596.477, 'target_text' => 'We know the rules when we are on the road.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tahu peraturannya apabila kita berada di atas jalan raya.', 'order' => 202],
            ['start_time' => 596.577, 'end_time' => 602.317, 'target_text' => 'We know the rules when we are brewing the coffee." They say you need to roast it up to a certain level.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tahu peraturannya semasa membancuh kopi." Mereka berpesan bahawa biji kopi perlu dipanggang sehingga ke tahap tertentu.', 'order' => 203],
            ['start_time' => 602.417, 'end_time' => 604.477, 'target_text' => 'Beyond that, you\'re going to mess it up.', 'source_text' => 'Jika melebihi tahap itu, rasanya akan rosak dan hancur.', 'order' => 204],
            ['start_time' => 604.577, 'end_time' => 605.277, 'target_text' => 'Agreed?', 'source_text' => 'Setuju bukan?', 'order' => 205],
            ['start_time' => 605.377, 'end_time' => 608.467, 'target_text' => 'You buy an expensive bean and guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Anda membeli biji kopi yang mahal, namun apa yang terjadi?', 'order' => 206],
            ['start_time' => 608.567, 'end_time' => 611.428, 'target_text' => 'You spoil it because you didn\'t know what to do.', 'source_text' => 'Anda merosakkannya kerana anda tidak tahu apa yang perlu dilakukan.', 'order' => 207],
            ['start_time' => 611.528, 'end_time' => 613.118, 'target_text' => 'So, we know it about all of that.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kita tahu selok-belok tentang semua urusan duniawi itu.', 'order' => 208],
            ['start_time' => 613.218, 'end_time' => 614.878, 'target_text' => 'What about our own faith?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pula dengan keimanan kita sendiri?', 'order' => 209],
            ['start_time' => 614.978, 'end_time' => 616.598, 'target_text' => 'What about conviction in Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pula dengan keyakinan yang teguh kepada Allah?', 'order' => 210],
            ['start_time' => 616.698, 'end_time' => 618.198, 'target_text' => 'What about connection with Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pula dengan hubungan rohani kita dengan Allah?', 'order' => 211],
            ['start_time' => 618.298, 'end_time' => 621.198, 'target_text' => 'What about connection with Rasulullah Sallallahu alaihi wasallam?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pula dengan tautan kasih kita dengan Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam?', 'order' => 212],
            ['start_time' => 621.298, 'end_time' => 630.188, 'target_text' => 'Afdalul khalqi wa AKRAMUR RUSULI, THE BEST of creation, the most noble of all prophets of Allah Sallallahu alaihi wasallam.', 'source_text' => 'Afdhalul khalqi wa akramur rusul, sebaik-baik sekalian makhluk, semulia-mulia para rasul utusan Allah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam.', 'order' => 213],
            ['start_time' => 630.288, 'end_time' => 631.508, 'target_text' => 'You know what I just said now?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang baru sahaja saya lafazkan sebentar tadi?', 'order' => 214],
            ['start_time' => 631.608, 'end_time' => 633.518, 'target_text' => 'Sallallahu alaihi wasallam.', 'source_text' => 'Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam.', 'order' => 215],
            ['start_time' => 633.618, 'end_time' => 639.818, 'target_text' => 'Once you say it, Allah blesses you 10 times minimum as a result.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaik sahaja anda mengucapkannya, Allah akan mengurniakan sekurang-kurangnya 10 rahmat ke atas diri anda.', 'order' => 216],
            ['start_time' => 640.088, 'end_time' => 643.748, 'target_text' => 'You want ease in your difficulty, in your hardship, go and read the sirah.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda inginkan kelapangan dalam kepayahan dan ujian hidup anda, pergilah membaca dan menghayati sirah.', 'order' => 217],
            ['start_time' => 643.848, 'end_time' => 644.678, 'target_text' => 'What is the sirah?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah itu sirah?', 'order' => 218],
            ['start_time' => 644.778, 'end_time' => 646.718, 'target_text' => 'The life of the Prophet Muhammad Sallallahu alaihi wasallam.', 'source_text' => 'Perjalanan riwayat hidup Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam.', 'order' => 219],
            ['start_time' => 646.818, 'end_time' => 657.758, 'target_text' => 'In it, he went through more hardship and more difficulty than any one of us simply for us to be able to follow that example', 'source_text' => 'Sepanjang kehidupannya, Baginda mengharungi lebih banyak kepayahan dan ujian berat berbanding sesiapa pun antara kita, semata-mata agar kita dapat mencontohi teladan itu', 'order' => 220],
            ['start_time' => 657.858, 'end_time' => 659.428, 'target_text' => 'and learn from it.', 'source_text' => 'dan mengambil pengajaran daripadanya.', 'order' => 221],
            ['start_time' => 659.528, 'end_time' => 668.718, 'target_text' => 'His rank WAS THE HIGHEST AND IT CONTINUES GOING HIGHER and higher as we breathe BECAUSE EVERY SINGLE THING WE DO is rewarded', 'source_text' => 'Darjat Baginda adalah yang paling tinggi dan darjat itu terus meningkat semakin tinggi setiap kali kita bernafas, kerana setiap kebaikan yang kita amalkan akan turut diganjari', 'order' => 222],
            ['start_time' => 668.818, 'end_time' => 669.218, 'target_text' => 'for it.', 'source_text' => 'pahala kepada Baginda.', 'order' => 223],
            ['start_time' => 669.298, 'end_time' => 672.678, 'target_text' => 'He was mu\'allimu al-bashariyati al-khair.', 'source_text' => 'Baginda adalah mu\'allimul basyariyati al-khair.', 'order' => 224],
            ['start_time' => 672.778, 'end_time' => 677.438, 'target_text' => 'He taught mankind all goodness and it did not stop just at mankind.', 'source_text' => 'Baginda mengajarkan segala bentuk kebaikan kepada sekalian umat manusia, dan kebaikan itu tidak terhenti setakat manusia sahaja.', 'order' => 225],
            ['start_time' => 677.538, 'end_time' => 679.588, 'target_text' => 'The topic continues.', 'source_text' => 'Perbincangan ini masih panjang.', 'order' => 226],
            ['start_time' => 679.688, 'end_time' => 686.038, 'target_text' => 'But we talk about remaining steadfast at the time of hardship is something that a believer should understand.', 'source_text' => 'Namun peringatan kita tentang kekal beristiqamah pada saat menghadapi ujian kesukaran adalah sesuatu yang wajib difahami oleh setiap orang beriman.', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 686.138, 'end_time' => 691.388, 'target_text' => 'We came onto this earth and Allah says, "I did not promise that you will not have hardship.', 'source_text' => 'Kita dilahirkan ke dunia ini dan Allah telah berfirman, "Aku tidak pernah menjanjikan bahawa kamu tidak akan ditimpa kesusahan.', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 691.488, 'end_time' => 697.308, 'target_text' => 'You will have hardship." I never promised even the saints that they will not have hardship.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu pasti akan menghadapi kepayahan." Bahkan kepada para wali dan orang soleh sekalipun tidak pernah dijanjikan bahawa mereka bebas daripada ujian.', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 697.408, 'end_time' => 703.748, 'target_text' => 'But when you\'re close to Allah, you actually begin to thank Allah', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila anda benar-benar dekat dengan Allah, anda akan mula memanjatkan kesyukuran kepada Allah', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 703.848, 'end_time' => 710.868, 'target_text' => 'for what he put in your life and you start thinking to yourself, alhamdulillah ala kulli hal.', 'source_text' => 'atas apa jua yang ditakdirkan-Nya dalam hidup anda, lalu anda mula berbisik dalam hati: alhamdulillah ala kulli hal.', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 710.968, 'end_time' => 714.068, 'target_text' => 'Wa a\'udhu billahi min hali ahlin nar.', 'source_text' => 'Wa a\'udhu billahi min hali ahlin nar.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 714.168, 'end_time' => 716.828, 'target_text' => 'We praise Allah upon all conditions.', 'source_text' => 'Segala puji bagi Allah dalam apa jua keadaan sekalipun.', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 716.928, 'end_time' => 718.238, 'target_text' => 'I have difficulties.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sendiri mempunyai pelbagai kesukaran hidup.', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 718.338, 'end_time' => 722.948, 'target_text' => 'You might look at me and think, "What problems does this guy have?" Wallahi, we have hardships.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin melihat saya dan berfikir, "Masalah apalah yang orang macam dia ada?" Demi Allah, kami juga menanggung pelbagai ujian kesusahan.', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 723.048, 'end_time' => 724.598, 'target_text' => 'But we thank Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kami sentiasa bersyukur kepada Allah.', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 724.698, 'end_time' => 728.828, 'target_text' => 'Allah will not burden anyone with more than they can manage.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak sesekali akan membebani seseorang melainkan apa yang termampu dipikulnya.', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 728.928, 'end_time' => 733.628, 'target_text' => 'That sabr, that patience, that steadfastness', 'source_text' => 'Kesabaran itu, ketabahan itu, keteguhan istiqamah itu', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 733.728, 'end_time' => 737.699, 'target_text' => 'is your ticket perhaps to Jannatul Firdaus.', 'source_text' => 'barangkali merupakan tiket utama anda menuju ke Jannatul Firdaus.', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 738.009, 'end_time' => 739.239, 'target_text' => 'That\'s that hardship.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hikmah di sebalik ujian kepayahan itu.', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 739.339, 'end_time' => 740.189, 'target_text' => 'Look at a mother.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah kepada pengorbanan seorang ibu.', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 740.289, 'end_time' => 742.349, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve given this example a few days ago.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah memberikan contoh ini beberapa hari yang lalu.', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 742.449, 'end_time' => 743.789, 'target_text' => 'I give it again.', 'source_text' => 'Saya kongsikan sekali lagi hari ini.', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 743.889, 'end_time' => 750.939, 'target_text' => 'Generally in our communities, we still have that where a mother', 'source_text' => 'Kebiasaannya dalam masyarakat kita, masih wujud keadaan di mana seorang ibu', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 751.089, 'end_time' => 755.149, 'target_text' => 'looks after the kids and the children and generally', 'source_text' => 'mengasuh dan menjaga anak-anak, dan kebiasaannya', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 755.249, 'end_time' => 758.999, 'target_text' => 'is not always the primary breadwinner, right?', 'source_text' => 'bukanlah pencari nafkah utama keluarga, betul bukan?', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 759.099, 'end_time' => 761.839, 'target_text' => 'I know communities in the West and everywhere else and even here.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tahu di Barat dan di serata tempat, malah di sini sekalipun,', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 761.939, 'end_time' => 764.269, 'target_text' => 'They rely sometimes on the mother and so on.', 'source_text' => 'kadangkala keluarga turut bergantung nafkah kepada si ibu dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 764.369, 'end_time' => 768.079, 'target_text' => 'The economic situation has become difficult and different across the globe.', 'source_text' => 'Keadaan ekonomi kini semakin mencabar dan berubah di seluruh pelosok dunia.', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 768.179, 'end_time' => 771.599, 'target_text' => 'But I\'m giving you an example of a mother who\'s got a few children.', 'source_text' => 'Namun saya berikan contoh seorang ibu yang mempunyai beberapa orang anak kecil.', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 771.699, 'end_time' => 773.079, 'target_text' => 'She gets up in the morning.', 'source_text' => 'Dia bangkit seawal pagi.', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 773.179, 'end_time' => 774.559, 'target_text' => 'She has to get the kids up.', 'source_text' => 'Dia perlu mengejutkan anak-anak bangun.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 774.659, 'end_time' => 775.789, 'target_text' => 'She has to get them ready.', 'source_text' => 'Dia perlu menyiapkan kelengkapan mereka.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 775.889, 'end_time' => 779.719, 'target_text' => 'She prepares something sometimes with very little or no help.', 'source_text' => 'Dia menyediakan makanan, kadangkala dengan sedikit atau tanpa sebarang bantuan.', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 779.819, 'end_time' => 782.699, 'target_text' => 'Do you agree this is happening in societies?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda bersetuju bahawa realiti ini sedang berlaku dalam masyarakat kita?', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 782.969, 'end_time' => 785.499, 'target_text' => 'Do you reckon it\'s fair?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda rasa ia satu keadaan yang adil?', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 785.609, 'end_time' => 788.669, 'target_text' => 'Let me not get myself into a mess.', 'source_text' => 'Biar saya tidak mencampuri perdebatan itu terlalu jauh.', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 788.769, 'end_time' => 792.159, 'target_text' => 'But I tell you Allah knows your struggles.', 'source_text' => 'Namun saya tegaskan bahawa Allah Maha Mengetahui segala jerih perit perjuangan anda.', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 792.259, 'end_time' => 795.919, 'target_text' => 'The kids don\'t listen sometimes as they grow older, they become rebellious.', 'source_text' => 'Anak-anak kadangkala tidak mahu mendengar kata apabila semakin membesar, mereka menjadi memberontak.', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 796.019, 'end_time' => 797.999, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes they don\'t talk to you in a good way.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala mereka tidak bercakap dengan anda secara sopan.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 798.099, 'end_time' => 798.999, 'target_text' => 'They are adolescent.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka sedang melalui fasa remaja.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 799.099, 'end_time' => 801.279, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes there is hardship AND DIFFICULTY.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala wujud kepayahan dan kesusahan yang amat berat.', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 801.379, 'end_time' => 802.839, 'target_text' => 'WHAT DO YOU THINK ALLAH IS DOING?', 'source_text' => 'PADA PANDANGAN ANDA, APAKAH YANG SEDANG ALLAH LAKUKAN?', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 802.939, 'end_time' => 808.429, 'target_text' => 'Do you reckon Allah is just sitting and astaghfirullah, I don\'t even want to say anything that is wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda menyangka bahawa Allah hanya berdiam diri dan astaghfirullah, saya tidak ingin menuturkan sebarang ungkapan yang salah.', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 808.529, 'end_time' => 810.839, 'target_text' => 'Allah Almighty is the creator.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Yang Maha Kuasa adalah Maha Pencipta.', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 810.939, 'end_time' => 816.839, 'target_text' => 'He will definitely recompense you in the greatest way for your sabr, your hardship, your hard WORK.', 'source_text' => 'Dia pasti akan membalas anda dengan sebaik-baik ganjaran yang terhebat atas kesabaran anda, kesusahan anda, dan penat lelah usaha anda.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 816.939, 'end_time' => 817.599, 'target_text' => 'AND GUESS WHAT?', 'source_text' => 'DAN TEKA APA YANG BERLAKU?', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 817.699, 'end_time' => 819.959, 'target_text' => 'FOR the mother, it\'s not just on a Monday.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi seorang ibu, perjuangan itu bukan sekadar pada hari Isnin.', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 820.059, 'end_time' => 823.319, 'target_text' => 'It\'s every day including the Saturdays and the Sundays.', 'source_text' => 'Ia berterusan setiap hari termasuk pada hari Sabtu dan hari Ahad.', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 823.419, 'end_time' => 826.239, 'target_text' => 'Just when you thought it\'s a Sunday, I\'m going to chill and rest.', 'source_text' => 'Baru sahaja anda menyangka hari ini hari Ahad, saya mahu berehat dan bertenang.', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 826.339, 'end_time' => 827.319, 'target_text' => 'Guess what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Teka apa yang terjadi?', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 827.419, 'end_time' => 830.199, 'target_text' => 'You hear the screams and the yells at 6:00 in the morning.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mendengar jeritan dan tangisan anak-anak seawal jam 6:00 pagi.', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 830.299, 'end_time' => 831.159, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 831.259, 'end_time' => 835.639, 'target_text' => 'And you start thinking, gosh, I thought I was going to go to bed and have a bit of a break.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda mula berfikir, alahai, tadi saya fikir saya boleh tidur lagi dan berehat sebentar.', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 835.739, 'end_time' => 836.759, 'target_text' => 'But this is happening.', 'source_text' => 'Namun inilah realiti yang sedang berlaku.', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 836.859, 'end_time' => 838.079, 'target_text' => 'So Allah watches.', 'source_text' => 'Ketahuilah bahawa Allah sentiasa memerhatikan anda.', 'order' => 276],
            ['start_time' => 838.179, 'end_time' => 839.639, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows your struggles.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Mengetahui setiap titisan keringat dan kesukaran anda.', 'order' => 277],
            ['start_time' => 839.739, 'end_time' => 843.399, 'target_text' => 'Similarly, when it comes to the men, sometimes we have different types of struggles.', 'source_text' => 'Begitu juga bagi kaum lelaki, kadangkala kita menghadapi cabaran dan perjuangan yang berbeza.', 'order' => 278],
            ['start_time' => 843.499, 'end_time' => 845.479, 'target_text' => 'And some of the sisters have whatever they have.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sebahagian kaum wanita pula mempunyai ujian masing-masing.', 'order' => 279],
            ['start_time' => 845.579, 'end_time' => 847.189, 'target_text' => 'We are finding it difficult to get married.', 'source_text' => 'Ada yang sukar untuk bertemu jodoh bagi mendirikan rumah tangga.', 'order' => 280],
            ['start_time' => 847.289, 'end_time' => 849.199, 'target_text' => 'When we are married, we are having issues and problems.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila sudah berkahwin, timbul pula pelbagai isu dan pertelingkahan.', 'order' => 281],
            ['start_time' => 849.299, 'end_time' => 851.279, 'target_text' => 'If we have children, I already mentioned them.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya dikurniakan anak, saya telah sebutkan tadi cabarannya.', 'order' => 282],
            ['start_time' => 851.379, 'end_time' => 852.679, 'target_text' => 'Some people don\'t have children.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian insan pula belum dikurniakan rezeki zuriat.', 'order' => 283],
            ['start_time' => 852.779, 'end_time' => 859.701, 'target_text' => 'The worst thing when you don\'t have a child is people asking you, "When are you planning to start a family?"', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang paling menyakitkan hati apabila anda belum memiliki anak adalah orang ramai yang sering bertanya, "Bila nak mula rancang ada anak?"', 'order' => 284],
            ['start_time' => 860.531, 'end_time' => 861.321, 'target_text' => 'Relax, brother.', 'source_text' => 'Bertenanglah wahai saudaraku.', 'order' => 285],
            ['start_time' => 861.421, 'end_time' => 864.671, 'target_text' => 'When am Allah will help us to start the family, man.', 'source_text' => 'Bila sampai masanya, Allah jua yang akan mengurniakan zuriat kepada kami, kawan.', 'order' => 286],
            ['start_time' => 864.771, 'end_time' => 867.441, 'target_text' => 'It\'s the worst thing you could do when people don\'t have children.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah perkara paling melukakan hati yang boleh anda tanyakan kepada pasangan yang belum dikurniakan anak.', 'order' => 287],
            ['start_time' => 867.541, 'end_time' => 871.191, 'target_text' => 'What do you think you Who do you think you are to ask me those questions?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah anda sehingga merasakan berhak untuk mengemukakan soalan-soalan peribadi sedemikian kepada saya?', 'order' => 288],
            ['start_time' => 871.291, 'end_time' => 878.241, 'target_text' => 'My brothers and sisters, as members of the Muslim ummah, don\'t become so personal with a person you\'re not so close to', 'source_text' => 'Saudara dan saudariku sekalian, sebagai anggota ummah Muslim, janganlah terlalu menyibuk hal peribadi orang lain yang tidak begitu rapat dengan anda', 'order' => 289],
            ['start_time' => 878.341, 'end_time' => 884.461, 'target_text' => 'by asking them questions that are none of your business.', 'source_text' => 'dengan bertanyakan soalan-soalan yang sama sekali bukan urusan anda.', 'order' => 290],
            ['start_time' => 884.651, 'end_time' => 890.041, 'target_text' => 'A few days ago, I watched a little clip of someone saying, "Never say none of your business." And I thought to myself, "I', 'source_text' => 'Beberapa hari lepas, saya menonton satu video pendek seseorang berkata, "Jangan sesekali katakan itu bukan urusan anda." Dan saya terfikir, "Saya', 'order' => 291],
            ['start_time' => 890.141, 'end_time' => 891.041, 'target_text' => 'beg to differ.', 'source_text' => 'tidak bersetuju sama sekali dengan kenyataan itu.', 'order' => 292],
            ['start_time' => 891.141, 'end_time' => 892.561, 'target_text' => 'I come from Southern Africa.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berasal dari Selatan Afrika.', 'order' => 293],
            ['start_time' => 892.661, 'end_time' => 896.141, 'target_text' => 'We will say, \'None of your beeswax.\'"', 'source_text' => 'Kami akan dengan tegas berkata, \'Itu bukan urusan kamu langsung.\'"', 'order' => 294],
            ['start_time' => 896.291, 'end_time' => 898.671, 'target_text' => 'May Allah almighty grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Kuasa mengurniakan kemudahan dan kelapangan kepada kita semua.', 'order' => 295],
            ['start_time' => 898.771, 'end_time' => 904.161, 'target_text' => 'My brothers and sisters, today I want to tell you a few things that will help you through your hardship.', 'source_text' => 'Saudara dan saudariku, hari ini saya ingin berkongsi beberapa perkara yang akan membantu anda mengharungi ujian kesusahan anda.', 'order' => 296],
            ['start_time' => 904.261, 'end_time' => 912.031, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve already mentioned in brief, you need to develop your connection with Allah primarily by starting with your salah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah sebutkan secara ringkas tadi, anda perlu membina tautan hubungan dengan Allah bermula terutamanya dengan mendirikan solat.', 'order' => 297],
            ['start_time' => 912.131, 'end_time' => 914.121, 'target_text' => 'And I know that the shahada is on our tongues.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya tahu bahawa kalimah syahadah sentiasa basah di lidah kita.', 'order' => 298],
            ['start_time' => 914.221, 'end_time' => 921.241, 'target_text' => 'We believe in Allah and we believe in the prophet Muhammad, we respect all of those who brought the deen to us, all of', 'source_text' => 'Kita beriman kepada Allah dan kita beriman kepada Nabi Muhammad, kita menghormati semua pihak yang telah menyampaikan agama ini kepada kita,', 'order' => 299],
            ['start_time' => 921.341, 'end_time' => 924.721, 'target_text' => 'them, everyone, including our teachers, those who taught us alif and ba.', 'source_text' => 'semua sekali termasuk para guru kita, mereka yang telah mengajar kita huruf alif dan ba.', 'order' => 300],
            ['start_time' => 924.821, 'end_time' => 931.321, 'target_text' => 'To us, they are receiving a full reward of every time we\'re reading anything from the Quran because those were people who', 'source_text' => 'Bagi kita, mereka sentiasa menerima ganjaran pahala yang penuh setiap kali kita membaca apa jua ayat daripada Al-Quran kerana merekalah insan yang', 'order' => 301],
            ['start_time' => 931.421, 'end_time' => 932.481, 'target_text' => 'made an effort on us.', 'source_text' => 'telah mencurahkan usaha membimbing kita.', 'order' => 302],
            ['start_time' => 932.581, 'end_time' => 933.841, 'target_text' => 'We may forget some of them.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mungkin terlupa sebahagian daripada nama mereka.', 'order' => 303],
            ['start_time' => 933.941, 'end_time' => 935.871, 'target_text' => 'Their reward continues clocking.', 'source_text' => 'Namun catatan pahala mereka terus mengalir tanpa henti.', 'order' => 304],
            ['start_time' => 935.971, 'end_time' => 944.471, 'target_text' => 'So, that is one thing, but the pillar of Islam after that that is the only pillar that actually we have no excuse not to', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, itu satu perkara, namun rukun Islam selepas itu yang merupakan satu-satunya rukun yang tiada sebarang alasan untuk kita', 'order' => 305],
            ['start_time' => 944.571, 'end_time' => 946.201, 'target_text' => 'engage in is salah.', 'source_text' => 'tinggalkan adalah solat.', 'order' => 306],
            ['start_time' => 946.301, 'end_time' => 950.441, 'target_text' => 'Because if you look at hajj, it\'s for those who are able and they have the money and capacity.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana jika anda melihat kepada ibadah haji, ia hanya diwajibkan bagi mereka yang berkemampuan dari segi kewangan dan fizikal.', 'order' => 307],
            ['start_time' => 950.541, 'end_time' => 953.441, 'target_text' => 'Look at zakat, it\'s for those who have the capacity.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah kepada zakat, ia hanya dituntut kepada mereka yang memiliki kecukupan nisab.', 'order' => 308],
            ['start_time' => 953.541, 'end_time' => 955.281, 'target_text' => 'Those who don\'t, they don\'t have to pay the zakat.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka yang tidak berkemampuan tidak diwajibkan membayar zakat.', 'order' => 309],
            ['start_time' => 955.381, 'end_time' => 957.161, 'target_text' => 'In fact, they can receive the zakat.', 'source_text' => 'Malah, mereka berhak menerima agihan zakat.', 'order' => 310],
            ['start_time' => 957.261, 'end_time' => 964.841, 'target_text' => 'Similarly, when it comes to fasting, we all have to fast besides when you\'re unwell or when you\'re traveling, you may fast', 'source_text' => 'Begitu juga dengan ibadah puasa, kita semua wajib berpuasa kecuali apabila anda jatuh sakit atau sedang bermusafir jauh, anda boleh menggantikannya', 'order' => 311],
            ['start_time' => 964.941, 'end_time' => 965.33, 'target_text' => 'later.', 'source_text' => 'di kemudian hari.', 'order' => 312],
            ['start_time' => 965.331, 'end_time' => 967.961, 'target_text' => 'And if you really can\'t, you can give a fidya on behalf of the fast.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya anda benar-benar uzur dan tidak mampu, anda boleh membayar fidyah sebagai ganti puasa tersebut.', 'order' => 313],
            ['start_time' => 968.061, 'end_time' => 968.801, 'target_text' => 'There are rules.', 'source_text' => 'Ada kelonggaran dan peraturannya.', 'order' => 314],
            ['start_time' => 968.901, 'end_time' => 971.671, 'target_text' => 'But salah, you have to.', 'source_text' => 'Namun bagi solat, anda wajib melaksanakannya.', 'order' => 315],
            ['start_time' => 971.771, 'end_time' => 972.721, 'target_text' => 'Salah, you have to.', 'source_text' => 'Solat, anda wajib mengerjakannya walau dalam keadaan apa sekalipun.', 'order' => 316],
            ['start_time' => 972.821, 'end_time' => 974.281, 'target_text' => 'May Allah make it easy for us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mempermudahkan urusan solat bagi kita semua.', 'order' => 317],
            ['start_time' => 974.381, 'end_time' => 976.041, 'target_text' => 'So, that\'s a good starting point.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, itulah titik permulaan terbaik yang perlu dibina.', 'order' => 318],
            ['start_time' => 976.141, 'end_time' => 978.322, 'target_text' => 'People tell me, "You know, I\'m far from Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang yang meluahkan kepada saya, "Anda tahu, saya berasa amat jauh daripada Allah.', 'order' => 319],
            ['start_time' => 978.422, 'end_time' => 979.392, 'target_text' => 'I really don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Saya benar-benar buntu.', 'order' => 320],
            ['start_time' => 979.492, 'end_time' => 980.602, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve committed all the sins.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah melakukan segala macam dosa.', 'order' => 321],
            ['start_time' => 980.702, 'end_time' => 981.682, 'target_text' => 'I\'m so embarrassed.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berasa sangat malu.', 'order' => 322],
            ['start_time' => 981.782, 'end_time' => 985.482, 'target_text' => 'There are sins that people don\'t even know about that I know about, that I\'ve committed.', 'source_text' => 'Ada dosa-dosa yang langsung tidak diketahui orang lain melainkan diri saya sendiri yang telah melakukannya."', 'order' => 323],
            ['start_time' => 985.582, 'end_time' => 990.442, 'target_text' => 'And I tell them, seek the forgiveness of Allah, build your relation with Allah and His messenger by starting off with your', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya berpesan kepada mereka: mohonlah keampunan daripada Allah, binalah semula hubungan anda dengan Allah dan Rasul-Nya bermula dengan', 'order' => 324],
            ['start_time' => 990.542, 'end_time' => 993.782, 'target_text' => 'five daily prayers as a non-compromisable.', 'source_text' => 'menjaga lima waktu solat fardhu sebagai satu perkara yang tidak boleh dikompromi sama sekali.', 'order' => 325],
            ['start_time' => 994.212, 'end_time' => 995.762, 'target_text' => 'Even if you have other weaknesses.', 'source_text' => 'Meskipun anda masih mempunyai pelbagai kelemahan lain.', 'order' => 326],
            ['start_time' => 995.862, 'end_time' => 999.322, 'target_text' => 'And if you fall in the weakness, quickly come back and start again.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya anda tergelincir dalam kelemahan itu, segeralah kembali bertaubat dan mulakan semula.', 'order' => 327],
            ['start_time' => 999.422, 'end_time' => 1002.512, 'target_text' => 'And if you fall in the weakness, come back and do it again.', 'source_text' => 'Dan jika anda terjatuh lagi, bangkitlah semula dan teruskan beribadah.', 'order' => 328],
            ['start_time' => 1002.612, 'end_time' => 1003.802, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t give up on your prayer.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan sesekali meninggalkan solat anda.', 'order' => 329],
            ['start_time' => 1003.902, 'end_time' => 1005.282, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t give up on your salah.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan berputus asa daripada mendirikan solat.', 'order' => 330],
            ['start_time' => 1005.382, 'end_time' => 1010.182, 'target_text' => 'Inna salata tanhaw anil fasha\'i wal munkar.', 'source_text' => 'Innas salata tanha \'anil fahsya\'i wal munkar.', 'order' => 331],
            ['start_time' => 1012.412, 'end_time' => 1021.352, 'target_text' => 'Salah itself will actually help you stay away from immorality and sin, that which is displeasing to Allah, especially when', 'source_text' => 'Solat itu sendiri yang sebenarnya akan membantu menghindarkan diri anda daripada perbuatan keji dan mungkar yang dimurkai Allah, terutamanya apabila', 'order' => 332],
            ['start_time' => 1021.452, 'end_time' => 1022.952, 'target_text' => 'your heart is connected to the prayer.', 'source_text' => 'hati anda benar-benar bertaut rapat dengan solat.', 'order' => 333],
            ['start_time' => 1023.052, 'end_time' => 1024.402, 'target_text' => 'So, connect your heart to prayer.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, tautkanlah hati anda dengan solat.', 'order' => 334],
            ['start_time' => 1024.502, 'end_time' => 1026.842, 'target_text' => 'You know what really moves me?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang benar-benar menyentuh perasaan saya?', 'order' => 335],
            ['start_time' => 1026.942, 'end_time' => 1031.722, 'target_text' => 'I\'m witnessing thousands or tens of thousands of people turning to Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sedang menyaksikan ribuan atau puluhan ribu manusia kembali memeluk agama Islam.', 'order' => 336],
            ['start_time' => 1031.822, 'end_time' => 1032.722, 'target_text' => 'Turning to Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Kembali memeluk Islam.', 'order' => 337],
            ['start_time' => 1032.822, 'end_time' => 1039.312, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t make a big deal about it because we don\'t need to, you know, uh actually announce it all over the world, but it\'s', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak menghebah-hebahkannya secara berlebihan kerana kita tidak perlu mengisytiharkannya ke serata dunia, namun hakikatnya fenomena itu', 'order' => 338],
            ['start_time' => 1039.412, 'end_time' => 1039.922, 'target_text' => 'there.', 'source_text' => 'benar-benar berlaku.', 'order' => 339],
            ['start_time' => 1040.022, 'end_time' => 1045.122, 'target_text' => 'But the scary part is there are people who are born in Islam, and sometimes they\'re dilly-dallying.', 'source_text' => 'Namun perkara yang merisaukan adalah wujudnya golongan yang dilahirkan sebagai Muslim, tetapi kadangkala mereka leka dan berlengah-lengah.', 'order' => 340],
            ['start_time' => 1045.222, 'end_time' => 1049.922, 'target_text' => 'And I\'ve come to the conclusion that one of the reasons is those people saw the darkness.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya membuat kesimpulan bahawa salah satu puncanya adalah kerana saudara baru tersebut pernah merasai kepekatan kegelapan.', 'order' => 341],
            ['start_time' => 1050.022, 'end_time' => 1054.162, 'target_text' => 'The light is so bright that they will never go back to the darkness after they seen the light.', 'source_text' => 'Cahaya hidayah ini begitu terang benderang sehingga mereka tidak akan sesekali mahu kembali ke lembah kegelapan selepas melihat cahaya tersebut.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1054.262, 'end_time' => 1058.642, 'target_text' => 'The problem with us, when we see the light, we don\'t appreciate that we\'re in the light.', 'source_text' => 'Masalah bagi kita pula adalah apabila kita sudah berada dalam cahaya, kita tidak mensyukuri nikmat berada di dalam cahaya itu.', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1058.742, 'end_time' => 1060.072, 'target_text' => 'You follow what I\'m saying?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda faham apa yang saya maksudkan?', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1060.172, 'end_time' => 1061.522, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t appreciate it.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak benar-benar menghargainya.', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1061.622, 'end_time' => 1065.522, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s why we say, learn, learn, enter the seminaries.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sebab itulah kami sentiasa berpesan: menuntutlah ilmu, belajarlah, masuklah ke pusat-pusat pengajian agama.', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1065.622, 'end_time' => 1067.392, 'target_text' => 'Go and study wherever it is.', 'source_text' => 'Pergilah mendalami ilmu di mana sahaja.', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1067.492, 'end_time' => 1071.762, 'target_text' => 'Go to your local masjid, develop a relation with those who are teaching the deen.', 'source_text' => 'Imarahkan masjid tempatan anda, binalah hubungan baik dengan para guru yang mengajarkan agama.', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1071.862, 'end_time' => 1072.522, 'target_text' => 'Attend.', 'source_text' => 'Hadirlah ke majlis ilmu.', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1072.622, 'end_time' => 1074.922, 'target_text' => 'And you know what, build your connection with Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ketahuilah, binalah tautan hubungan anda dengan Allah.', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1075.022, 'end_time' => 1076.722, 'target_text' => 'That\'s how you will develop.', 'source_text' => 'Begitulah caranya keimanan anda akan berkembang subur.', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1076.822, 'end_time' => 1081.602, 'target_text' => 'Learn the Quran, study it under someone who knows what they\'re talking about.', 'source_text' => 'Pelajarilah Al-Quran, telaahlah ia di bawah bimbingan guru yang benar-benar berilmu dan memahami apa yang diajarkannya.', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1081.702, 'end_time' => 1086.622, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t just go to TikTok and see whatever is ticking and talking there.', 'source_text' => 'Janganlah semata-mata mencari ilmu di aplikasi TikTok dan mempercayai apa sahaja kandungan yang tular di sana.', 'order' => 353],
            ['start_time' => 1087.092, 'end_time' => 1094.592, 'target_text' => 'You may be motivated by a thing or two, but you can also be misguided very, very dangerously from the same platforms.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin termotivasi oleh satu dua perkara, namun anda juga boleh disesatkan dengan cara yang sangat-sangat berbahaya daripada platform yang sama.', 'order' => 354],
            ['start_time' => 1094.692, 'end_time' => 1101.542, 'target_text' => 'There are people there who are planted in order to create doubt in your heart and mind.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat pihak di luar sana yang sengaja ditanam untuk mencetuskan keraguan dan syubhat di dalam hati dan fikiran anda.', 'order' => 355],
            ['start_time' => 1101.853, 'end_time' => 1104.243, 'target_text' => 'I\'m going to tell you something that I haven\'t really spoken about.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin berkongsi sesuatu yang belum pernah saya ceritakan secara terbuka.', 'order' => 356],
            ['start_time' => 1104.343, 'end_time' => 1107.753, 'target_text' => 'I met Ahmed Deedat Ali.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah bertemu dengan Syeikh Ahmed Deedat.', 'order' => 357],
            ['start_time' => 1107.853, 'end_time' => 1116.313, 'target_text' => 'And I met him sometime back and actually I led the Janazah prayer of Ahmed Deedat by his own wasiyah, by his own request.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya pernah menemuinya suatu ketika dahulu, dan sebenarnya sayalah yang mengimamkan solat jenazah Ahmed Deedat atas wasiat dan permintaan beliau sendiri.', 'order' => 358],
            ['start_time' => 1116.413, 'end_time' => 1117.763, 'target_text' => 'Ali.', 'source_text' => 'Rahimahullah.', 'order' => 359],
            ['start_time' => 1117.863, 'end_time' => 1121.123, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t think I was deserving of it, but anyway, when I found out, I obliged.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak merasakan diri saya layak untuk penghormatan itu, namun apabila dimaklumkan mengenai wasiat tersebut, saya tunaikannya.', 'order' => 360],
            ['start_time' => 1121.223, 'end_time' => 1122.603, 'target_text' => 'But I tell you something very interesting.', 'source_text' => 'Namun saya ingin berkongsi satu perkara yang amat menarik.', 'order' => 361],
            ['start_time' => 1122.703, 'end_time' => 1125.843, 'target_text' => 'He told me, and he couldn\'t really speak with his mouth.', 'source_text' => 'Beliau berpesan kepada saya, dan sewaktu itu beliau sudah tidak mampu bercakap menggunakan mulutnya.', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1125.943, 'end_time' => 1128.593, 'target_text' => 'He used to communicate with his eyes at one stage.', 'source_text' => 'Beliau hanya berkomunikasi menggunakan isyarat matanya pada peringkat akhir kehidupannya.', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1128.693, 'end_time' => 1132.993, 'target_text' => 'If those of you who know, if you don\'t know, you can go and check it out.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi anda yang mengetahui kisahnya—jika belum tahu, anda boleh menyelidik dan membacanya.', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1133.093, 'end_time' => 1135.243, 'target_text' => 'How he spoke by the movement of his eyes.', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana beliau mampu berkomunikasi melalui pergerakan anak matanya.', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1135.343, 'end_time' => 1138.153, 'target_text' => 'And it took him a long time to tell me, "Do you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan beliau mengambil masa yang lama untuk menyampaikan kepada saya: "Tahukah anda?', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1138.253, 'end_time' => 1139.713, 'target_text' => 'I', 'source_text' => 'Saya', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1139.813, 'end_time' => 1143.713, 'target_text' => 'was trained by myself in many things.', 'source_text' => 'melatih diri saya sendiri dalam pelbagai perkara.', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1143.813, 'end_time' => 1147.083, 'target_text' => 'You know, there\'s a whole history of how what happened to him happened.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, ada sejarah panjang mengenai apa yang telah menimpa ke atas diri beliau.', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1147.183, 'end_time' => 1153.313, 'target_text' => 'He says, "All you have to do is to create a doubt', 'source_text' => 'Beliau berpesan: "Apa yang pihak musuh perlu lakukan hanyalah mencetuskan satu benih keraguan', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1153.413, 'end_time' => 1154.203, 'target_text' => 'in the heart.', 'source_text' => 'di dalam hati sanubari manusia.', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1154.303, 'end_time' => 1156.203, 'target_text' => 'The rest is done by Allah." Wow.', 'source_text' => 'Selebihnya diserahkan kepada ketetapan Allah." Sungguh mendalam.', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1156.303, 'end_time' => 1159.153, 'target_text' => 'I didn\'t really understand what exactly he meant at that moment.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak begitu memahami maksud sebenar pesanan itu pada ketika itu.', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1159.253, 'end_time' => 1166.223, 'target_text' => 'And I thought of it later I said, "The enemy is doing it to us who have less knowledge."', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila saya merenungkannya semula kemudian hari, saya sedar: "Pihak musuh sedang melakukan perkara yang sama kepada kita yang kurang ilmu ini."', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1166.933, 'end_time' => 1173.873, 'target_text' => 'When the youngsters are too busy and we\'ve sent them TO THE TOP SCHOOL, SO THEY KNOW everything', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anak-anak muda kita terlalu sibuk dan kita menghantar mereka ke sekolah elit terbaik, sehingga mereka menguasai segala ilmu', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1173.973, 'end_time' => 1175.193, 'target_text' => 'secular.', 'source_text' => 'duniawi dan sekular.', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1175.293, 'end_time' => 1176.883, 'target_text' => 'Islamically, they are nowhere.', 'source_text' => 'Namun dari sudut kefahaman Islam, mereka langsung tiada asas kukuh.', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1176.983, 'end_time' => 1177.763, 'target_text' => 'Because why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah perkara itu berlaku?', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1177.863, 'end_time' => 1181.843, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t know how to read Quran and the youngsters 14 years old, 15 years old.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana mereka tidak tahu bagaimana membaca Al-Quran, malah anak-anak muda yang berusia 14 atau 15 tahun', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1181.943, 'end_time' => 1183.683, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t have a connection with any scholar.', 'source_text' => 'langsung tidak mempunyai hubungan bimbingan dengan mana-mana ulama.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1183.783, 'end_time' => 1187.643, 'target_text' => 'You ask them, "Who do you have a connection?" They can\'t name anyone in Cape Town.', 'source_text' => 'Bila anda tanya kepada mereka, "Dengan siapakah anda berguru?" Mereka tidak mampu menamakan seorang pun guru di Cape Town.', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1187.743, 'end_time' => 1190.603, 'target_text' => 'They can\'t tell you, "I\'m connected to this person, this masjid.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tidak dapat berkata, "Saya berhubung rapat dengan ustaz ini, masjid ini.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1190.703, 'end_time' => 1193.323, 'target_text' => 'I pray here." I am proud of any youngster.', 'source_text' => 'Saya menunaikan solat di sini." Saya amat berbangga dengan mana-mana anak muda yang mempunyai tautan masjid.', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1193.423, 'end_time' => 1194.793, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t care where you go.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak kisah masjid mana yang anda pilih untuk hadir.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1194.893, 'end_time' => 1200.923, 'target_text' => 'You have a connection with Allah through the house of Allah, inshallah, there is hope for the future of the ummah.', 'source_text' => 'Asalkan anda mempunyai hubungan dengan Allah melalui rumah-rumah Allah, insya-Allah, masih ada harapan cerah untuk masa depan ummah.', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1201.023, 'end_time' => 1203.063, 'target_text' => 'There is hope.', 'source_text' => 'Masih ada harapan yang besar.', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1203.693, 'end_time' => 1205.883, 'target_text' => 'And there will always be bickering and politics.', 'source_text' => 'Dan pertikaian remeh serta perselisihan politik akan sentiasa wujud.', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1205.983, 'end_time' => 1207.723, 'target_text' => 'That\'s everywhere across the globe.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara itu berlaku di mana-mana sahaja di seluruh dunia.', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1207.823, 'end_time' => 1208.603, 'target_text' => 'Rise above it.', 'source_text' => 'Bangkitlah melangkaui perkara-perkara remeh tersebut.', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1208.703, 'end_time' => 1211.913, 'target_text' => 'Be a person who cares for the entire ummah.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah insan yang benar-benar mengambil berat tentang keseluruhan ummah.', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1212.013, 'end_time' => 1214.323, 'target_text' => 'Be a person who cares for the entire ummah.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah seorang peribadi yang prihatin kepada segenap lapisan umat.', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1214.423, 'end_time' => 1222.123, 'target_text' => 'That\'s one of the ways I have witnessed in my travels across the globe that people want us to lose is by making us dispute', 'source_text' => 'Itulah salah satu cara yang saya saksikan dalam musafir saya ke seluruh pelosok dunia—bagaimana musuh mahu kita tewas adalah dengan melaga-lagakan kita', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1222.223, 'end_time' => 1222.845, 'target_text' => 'with one another.', 'source_text' => 'supaya saling bertelingkah sesama sendiri.', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1222.945, 'end_time' => 1224.795, 'target_text' => 'we lose OUR ENERGY.', 'source_text' => 'Sehingga kita kehilangan kekuatan dan tenaga kita.', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1224.895, 'end_time' => 1230.555, 'target_text' => 'HAS HAPPENED SIMPLY BECAUSE WE ARE SO DISUNITED that they', 'source_text' => 'Tragedi demi tragedi menimpa saudara kita semata-mata kerana kita terlalu berpecah-belah sehingga mereka', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1230.655, 'end_time' => 1232.125, 'target_text' => 'are suffering the genocide.', 'source_text' => 'terpaksa menderita pembunuhan beramai-ramai (genosid).', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1232.225, 'end_time' => 1242.185, 'target_text' => 'I believe if we would care for one another in the true sense and we were united, nobody would dare point a finger at us.', 'source_text' => 'Saya yakin sekiranya kita benar-benar menyayangi antara satu sama lain dalam erti kata sebenar dan kita bersatu padu, tiada sesiapa pun yang berani menuding jari kepada kita.', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1242.775, 'end_time' => 1244.005, 'target_text' => 'So, we\'re all guilty.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kita semua sebenarnya turut bersalah.', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1244.105, 'end_time' => 1246.325, 'target_text' => 'People look and say, "What did you do?" Brother, what did you do?', 'source_text' => 'Orang ramai melihat dan bertanya, "Apa yang telah kamu lakukan?" Saudaraku, apa pula yang telah kamu lakukan?', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1246.425, 'end_time' => 1247.755, 'target_text' => 'What did we do as an ummah?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang telah kita sumbangkan sebagai satu ummah?', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1247.855, 'end_time' => 1249.395, 'target_text' => 'What did we do?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang telah kita lakukan?', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1249.495, 'end_time' => 1251.445, 'target_text' => 'People say, "You don\'t talk." I\'m talking here right now.', 'source_text' => 'Orang berkata, "Anda tidak bersuara." Saya sedang bersuara lantang di sini sekarang.', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1251.545, 'end_time' => 1251.995, 'target_text' => 'Can you hear it?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah anda mendengarnya?', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1252.095, 'end_time' => 1253.435, 'target_text' => 'Hello.', 'source_text' => 'Helo semua.', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1253.535, 'end_time' => 1254.835, 'target_text' => 'There we go.', 'source_text' => 'Dengarlah dengan jelas.', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1254.935, 'end_time' => 1258.165, 'target_text' => 'IT\'S A GENOCIDE AND DON\'T EVER BE FOOLED THAT IT HAS STOPPED.', 'source_text' => 'IA MERUPAKAN SATU GENOSID (PEMBUNUHAN BERAMAI-RAMAI) DAN JANGAN SESEKALI TERPEDAYA BAHAWA IA TELAH BERHENTI.', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1258.265, 'end_time' => 1259.195, 'target_text' => 'IT HAS NOT STOPPED.', 'source_text' => 'IA SAMA SEKALI BELUM BERHENTI.', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1259.295, 'end_time' => 1260.405, 'target_text' => 'IT CONTINUES.', 'source_text' => 'IA MASIH BERTERUSAN BERLAKU.', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1260.505, 'end_time' => 1264.245, 'target_text' => 'THEY MADE a fool of us by thinking, "Ah, there\'s a ceasefire." What ceasefire?', 'source_text' => 'MEREKA MEMPERBODOHKAN KITA dengan menyangka, "Ah, ada gencatan senjata." Gencatan senjata apa?', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1264.345, 'end_time' => 1264.845, 'target_text' => 'Where?', 'source_text' => 'Di manakah gencatan senjata itu?', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1264.945, 'end_time' => 1265.475, 'target_text' => 'People are dying.', 'source_text' => 'Manusia tidak berdosa sedang dibunuh setiap hari.', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1265.575, 'end_time' => 1267.395, 'target_text' => 'Today they died.', 'source_text' => 'Hari ini pun mereka terkorban.', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1267.495, 'end_time' => 1268.245, 'target_text' => 'Today.', 'source_text' => 'Hari ini juga.', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1268.345, 'end_time' => 1270.045, 'target_text' => 'And we\'re sitting here calm, cool.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita di sini duduk dengan tenang, bersahaja.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1270.145, 'end_time' => 1270.645, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah demikian?', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1270.745, 'end_time' => 1272.435, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1272.535, 'end_time' => 1280.155, 'target_text' => 'I promise you if we don\'t develop a feeling for one another and a care for the ummah, we are doomed.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bersumpah kepada anda sekiranya kita tidak menanam rasa empati sesama sendiri dan kepedulian terhadap ummah, kita pasti akan musnah.', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1280.255, 'end_time' => 1281.245, 'target_text' => 'We are doomed.', 'source_text' => 'Kita pasti akan hancur binasa.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1281.345, 'end_time' => 1289.805, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t like these voices that call for us to come together and to be able to at least FOCUS ON SOMETHING COMMON THAT\'S', 'source_text' => 'Pihak musuh tidak menyukai suara-suara yang menyeru kita bersatu padu dan sekurang-kurangnya MEMBERI TUMPUAN KEPADA PERSAMAAN KITA YANG', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1289.905, 'end_time' => 1291.605, 'target_text' => 'GOING TO SWALLOW ALL OF US.', 'source_text' => 'AKAN MENYELAMATKAN KITA SEMUA.', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1291.705, 'end_time' => 1297.955, 'target_text' => 'WE ARE DOING A BETTER JOB OF SPLITTING ourselves than THE ENEMY EVER DREAMT OF.', 'source_text' => 'KITA SEBENARNYA LEBIH PANDAI MEMECAHBELAHKAN DIRI KITA SENDIRI berbanding apa yang pernah dimimpikan oleh pihak musuh.', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1298.055, 'end_time' => 1299.085, 'target_text' => 'WE\'RE DOING A BETTER JOB.', 'source_text' => 'KITA LEBIH \'CEKAP\' MEMECAHKAN KESATUAN KITA SENDIRI.', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1299.185, 'end_time' => 1303.845, 'target_text' => 'LIKE THEY SAY, SOMETIMES A PERSON SINS SO BADLY THAT EVEN SHAITAN IS EMBARRASSED.', 'source_text' => 'SEPERTI KATA PEPATAH, KADANGKALA SESEORANG BERBUAT DOSA DENGAN BEGITU TERUK SEHINGGAKAN SYAITAN PUN TURUT TERKEJUT DAN MALU.', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1303.945, 'end_time' => 1309.145, 'target_text' => 'HE SAYS, "HEY, I didn\'t really think of this." That\'s what\'s happening to us.', 'source_text' => 'SYAITAN BERKATA, "EH, AKU SENDIRI TAK PERNAH FIKIR NAK BUAT SAMPAI SEBEGITU SEKALI." Itulah hakikat yang sedang menimpa kita.', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1309.295, 'end_time' => 1314.445, 'target_text' => 'WE DO THINGS SO BADLY THAT THE ENEMY LOOKS AT US and says, "Hey, hey, these guys are doing a better job than we thought', 'source_text' => 'KITA MELAKUKAN PERKARA DENGAN BEGITU BURUK SEHINGGAKAN MUSUH MELIHAT KITA dan berkata, "Tengok tu, mereka sendiri hancurkan sesama mereka lebih baik daripada kita."', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1314.545, 'end_time' => 1317.765, 'target_text' => 'we would do, man." So, don\'t be fooled.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi janganlah tertipu.', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1317.865, 'end_time' => 1325.035, 'target_text' => 'I believe anyone who MAKES YOU HATE ONE another completely, you need to doubt them.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berpegang bahawa sesiapa sahaja yang MENYEMAI KEBENCIAN TOTAL SESAMA KITA, anda patut meragui niat mereka.', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1325.135, 'end_time' => 1327.965, 'target_text' => 'That this person perhaps is serving some agenda that we don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Kemungkinan orang ini sedang berkhidmat untuk agenda tertentu yang tidak kita ketahui.', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1328.065, 'end_time' => 1329.365, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t weaken the ummah.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan melemahkan kekuatan ummah.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1329.465, 'end_time' => 1330.085, 'target_text' => 'Talk about it.', 'source_text' => 'Bercakaplah secara jujur.', 'order' => 430],
            ['start_time' => 1330.185, 'end_time' => 1331.885, 'target_text' => 'Discuss your differences respectfully.', 'source_text' => 'Bincangkan perbezaan pandangan anda dengan penuh rasa hormat.', 'order' => 431],
            ['start_time' => 1331.985, 'end_time' => 1336.085, 'target_text' => 'I gave a topic on Jumu\'ah about respect and go and check it out.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah menyampaikan khutbah Jumaat mengenai saling menghormati dan anda boleh mencarinya untuk ditonton.', 'order' => 432],
            ['start_time' => 1336.185, 'end_time' => 1345.435, 'target_text' => 'I said, "We are suffering primarily because we have not learned to respect each other when we differ."', 'source_text' => 'Saya menegaskan, "Kita sedang menderita hari ini terutamanya kerana kita tidak pernah belajar untuk saling menghormati ketika kita berbeza pandangan."', 'order' => 433],
            ['start_time' => 1345.535, 'end_time' => 1347.156, 'target_text' => 'When we differ.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila kita berbeza pandangan.', 'order' => 434],
            ['start_time' => 1347.256, 'end_time' => 1350.446, 'target_text' => 'I differ with you, but I love you because I have a thousand things in common.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mungkin berbeza pandangan dengan anda, namun saya menyayangi anda kerana kita mempunyai seribu satu perkara persamaan akidah yang sama.', 'order' => 435],
            ['start_time' => 1350.546, 'end_time' => 1352.526, 'target_text' => 'Five things I differ very strongly with you.', 'source_text' => 'Ada lima perkara yang saya amat tidak bersetuju dengan anda.', 'order' => 436],
            ['start_time' => 1352.626, 'end_time' => 1353.246, 'target_text' => 'I will hug you.', 'source_text' => 'Namun saya tetap akan memeluk anda sebagai saudara.', 'order' => 437],
            ['start_time' => 1353.346, 'end_time' => 1356.556, 'target_text' => 'I will give my life for you because you utter the shahada.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sanggup berkorban nyawa mempertahankan anda semata-mata kerana anda melafazkan kalimah syahadah.', 'order' => 438],
            ['start_time' => 1356.656, 'end_time' => 1360.286, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, if that is the attitude we have achieved.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, sekiranya sikap sebegitu yang berjaya kita semai, kita telah mencapai kemenangan hakiki.', 'order' => 439],
            ['start_time' => 1360.386, 'end_time' => 1361.596, 'target_text' => 'Here we are in Cape Town.', 'source_text' => 'Kini kita berada di Cape Town.', 'order' => 440],
            ['start_time' => 1361.696, 'end_time' => 1364.806, 'target_text' => 'We\'re sitting in this beautiful CTICC.', 'source_text' => 'Kita duduk bersama di dewan CTICC yang indah ini.', 'order' => 441],
            ['start_time' => 1364.906, 'end_time' => 1368.286, 'target_text' => 'I promise you, do we really love each other here?', 'source_text' => 'Saya bertanya kepada anda: adakah kita benar-benar saling menyayangi di sini?', 'order' => 442],
            ['start_time' => 1368.386, 'end_time' => 1370.556, 'target_text' => 'The answer should be yes.', 'source_text' => 'Jawapannya semestinya ya.', 'order' => 443],
            ['start_time' => 1370.656, 'end_time' => 1372.786, 'target_text' => 'Yes, we do.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, kita saling berkasih sayang.', 'order' => 444],
            ['start_time' => 1373.096, 'end_time' => 1375.636, 'target_text' => 'You know, I was shocked because', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, saya agak terkejut kerana', 'order' => 445],
            ['start_time' => 1375.736, 'end_time' => 1379.596, 'target_text' => 'of late we\'ve been asked a question by many people.', 'source_text' => 'kebelakangan ini kami sering diajukan satu soalan oleh ramai orang.', 'order' => 446],
            ['start_time' => 1379.696, 'end_time' => 1382.476, 'target_text' => 'Will my cat be in paradise?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah kucing kesayangan saya akan masuk ke dalam syurga?', 'order' => 447],
            ['start_time' => 1382.576, 'end_time' => 1384.646, 'target_text' => 'Yes, many people are asking this question.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, ramai orang mengemukakan soalan ini.', 'order' => 448],
            ['start_time' => 1384.746, 'end_time' => 1387.156, 'target_text' => 'Will my pet be in paradise?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah haiwan peliharaan saya akan bersama saya di dalam syurga?', 'order' => 449],
            ['start_time' => 1387.256, 'end_time' => 1388.446, 'target_text' => 'The pet passes away.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila haiwan peliharaan itu mati.', 'order' => 450],
            ['start_time' => 1388.546, 'end_time' => 1392.406, 'target_text' => 'Do you know that when your pet dies, it\'s quite traumatic.', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda bahawa apabila haiwan peliharaan anda mati, ia merupakan satu pengalaman yang agak menyedihkan dan mencuit emosi.', 'order' => 451],
            ['start_time' => 1392.506, 'end_time' => 1395.476, 'target_text' => 'If you end up crying, those tears are actually permissible tears.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda menitiskan air mata, tangisan itu sebenarnya merupakan titisan air mata yang diharuskan dalam syariat.', 'order' => 452],
            ['start_time' => 1395.576, 'end_time' => 1396.886, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a coping mechanism.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah fitrah manusiawi untuk melegakan kesedihan.', 'order' => 453],
            ['start_time' => 1396.986, 'end_time' => 1398.356, 'target_text' => 'I\'m not questioning Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak mempersoalkan ketetapan Allah.', 'order' => 454],
            ['start_time' => 1398.456, 'end_time' => 1401.596, 'target_text' => 'I\'m going to as a human being I will miss my cat.', 'source_text' => 'Sebagai seorang manusia biasa, saya pasti akan merindui kucing peliharaan saya.', 'order' => 455],
            ['start_time' => 1401.696, 'end_time' => 1402.406, 'target_text' => 'Why not?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa tidak?', 'order' => 456],
            ['start_time' => 1402.506, 'end_time' => 1404.836, 'target_text' => 'Is it permissible to miss your cat?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah dibolehkan untuk merindui kucing anda?', 'order' => 457],
            ['start_time' => 1404.936, 'end_time' => 1405.846, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, it\'s permissible.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, ia adalah perkara yang diharuskan.', 'order' => 458],
            ['start_time' => 1405.946, 'end_time' => 1407.076, 'target_text' => 'You can.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh merinduinya.', 'order' => 459],
            ['start_time' => 1407.176, 'end_time' => 1411.316, 'target_text' => 'So long as you don\'t go and do a salat al-janazah and all that for the cat, you know.', 'source_text' => 'Asalkan anda tidak pergi mendirikan solat jenazah dan sebagainya untuk kucing tersebut, faham kan?', 'order' => 460],
            ['start_time' => 1411.416, 'end_time' => 1412.676, 'target_text' => 'Yeah?', 'source_text' => 'Faham kan?', 'order' => 461],
            ['start_time' => 1412.776, 'end_time' => 1415.636, 'target_text' => 'And you start coming to tell me, oh, you know, now this Anyway, let\'s leave that.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kemudian datang mengadu kepada saya pelbagai perkara... apa pun, biarlah kita tinggalkan hal itu di situ.', 'order' => 462],
            ['start_time' => 1415.736, 'end_time' => 1420.366, 'target_text' => 'So, but the question is, will my cat be with me in Jannah?', 'source_text' => 'Namun persoalannya adalah, adakah kucing saya akan bersama saya di dalam syurga?', 'order' => 463],
            ['start_time' => 1420.466, 'end_time' => 1421.046, 'target_text' => 'So, you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Ketahuilah,', 'order' => 464],
            ['start_time' => 1421.146, 'end_time' => 1425.346, 'target_text' => 'To be honest with you, that\'s a whole detailed discussion.', 'source_text' => 'sejujurnya dengan anda, perbahasan mengenai hal itu adalah satu topik perbincangan yang panjang dan terperinci.', 'order' => 465],
            ['start_time' => 1425.536, 'end_time' => 1427.646, 'target_text' => 'But from the question we learn something.', 'source_text' => 'Namun di sebalik soalan itu, kita dapat mempelajari satu pengajaran yang amat mendalam.', 'order' => 466],
            ['start_time' => 1427.746, 'end_time' => 1429.116, 'target_text' => 'You know what we learn?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apakah pengajaran yang kita pelajari?', 'order' => 467],
            ['start_time' => 1429.216, 'end_time' => 1434.436, 'target_text' => 'People want their cats in Jannah, but they don\'t want another Muslim in Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Manusia bersungguh-sungguh mahu kucing mereka masuk ke dalam syurga, tetapi mereka tidak mahu melihat saudara Muslim mereka sendiri masuk ke dalam syurga.', 'order' => 468],
            ['start_time' => 1434.536, 'end_time' => 1435.556, 'target_text' => 'How\'s that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah boleh jadi begitu?', 'order' => 469],
            ['start_time' => 1435.656, 'end_time' => 1437.156, 'target_text' => 'How\'s the point?', 'source_text' => 'Tidakkah itu satu renungan yang mendalam?', 'order' => 470],
            ['start_time' => 1437.256, 'end_time' => 1440.246, 'target_text' => 'I remember a guy, a football player.', 'source_text' => 'Saya teringat seorang pemain bola sepak terkenal.', 'order' => 471],
            ['start_time' => 1440.346, 'end_time' => 1440.705, 'target_text' => 'Who was he?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah dia?', 'order' => 472],
            ['start_time' => 1440.706, 'end_time' => 1441.206, 'target_text' => 'Brazilian.', 'source_text' => 'Seorang pemain Brazil.', 'order' => 473],
            ['start_time' => 1441.306, 'end_time' => 1443.076, 'target_text' => 'What was his name?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah namanya?', 'order' => 474],
            ['start_time' => 1443.176, 'end_time' => 1444.286, 'target_text' => 'Carlos, Ricardo.', 'source_text' => 'Carlos, Ricardo?', 'order' => 475],
            ['start_time' => 1444.386, 'end_time' => 1446.316, 'target_text' => 'What was his name?', 'source_text' => 'Siapa namanya?', 'order' => 476],
            ['start_time' => 1446.416, 'end_time' => 1447.246, 'target_text' => 'Roberto Carlos.', 'source_text' => 'Roberto Carlos.', 'order' => 477],
            ['start_time' => 1447.346, 'end_time' => 1448.446, 'target_text' => 'The whole of Cape Town knows him.', 'source_text' => 'Seluruh warga Cape Town mengenalinya.', 'order' => 478],
            ['start_time' => 1448.546, 'end_time' => 1449.286, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'order' => 479],
            ['start_time' => 1449.386, 'end_time' => 1450.526, 'target_text' => 'Do you remember WHAT THEY SAID ABOUT HIM?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda ingat APA YANG ORANG RAMAI PERNAH HEBAHKAN TENTANG DIA?', 'order' => 480],
            ['start_time' => 1450.626, 'end_time' => 1451.036, 'target_text' => 'MASHA ALLAH.', 'source_text' => 'MASHA ALLAH.', 'order' => 481],
            ['start_time' => 1451.136, 'end_time' => 1455.326, 'target_text' => 'THEY SAID he\'s a Muslim until he made an announcement to say he\'s married to a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'MEREKA MENDAKWA bahawa dia telah memeluk Islam, sehinggalah dia sendiri membuat kenyataan rasmi menyatakan bahawa isterinya yang beragama Islam.', 'order' => 482],
            ['start_time' => 1455.426, 'end_time' => 1457.926, 'target_text' => 'He respects Islam, but he\'s not a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Dia menghormati Islam, tetapi dia sendiri bukan seorang Muslim.', 'order' => 483],
            ['start_time' => 1458.026, 'end_time' => 1463.846, 'target_text' => 'But before he made the clarification, we brought someone who\'s not a Muslim into Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Namun sebelum dia membuat penjelasan itu, kita bersungguh-sungguh memasukkan orang yang bukan Islam ke dalam kelompok Islam.', 'order' => 484],
            ['start_time' => 1463.946, 'end_time' => 1468.406, 'target_text' => 'BUT THE SAME PEOPLE TOOK OUT A THOUSAND PEOPLE WHO WERE MUSLIMS FROM ISLAM.', 'source_text' => 'NAMUN ORANG YANG SAMA JUGA DENGAN MUDAH MENGELUARKAN SERIBU ORANG MUSLIM YANG SEBENAR DARIPADA AGAMA ISLAM.', 'order' => 485],
            ['start_time' => 1468.506, 'end_time' => 1471.948, 'target_text' => 'WHERE IS WHERE MAKE it make sense for me, please.', 'source_text' => 'DI MANAKAH LOGIKNYA? Tolong jelaskan kepada saya di mana kewarasannya.', 'order' => 486],
            ['start_time' => 1472.057, 'end_time' => 1474.197, 'target_text' => 'We are taught that it is one sign.', 'source_text' => 'Kita diajarkan bahawa ia adalah tanda kelemahan hati.', 'order' => 487],
            ['start_time' => 1474.297, 'end_time' => 1477.847, 'target_text' => 'At least say he\'s a Muslim, but I disagree with him XYZ, but I love the guy.', 'source_text' => 'Sekurang-kurangnya katakanlah, "Dia seorang Muslim, tetapi saya tidak bersetuju dengannya dalam isu sekian-sekian, namun saya tetap menyayanginya sebagai saudara seakidah."', 'order' => 488],
            ['start_time' => 1477.947, 'end_time' => 1478.928, 'target_text' => 'It\'s okay.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak mengapa.', 'order' => 489],
            ['start_time' => 1479.028, 'end_time' => 1480.237, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s mature ourselves.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita mematangkan diri kita.', 'order' => 490],
            ['start_time' => 1480.337, 'end_time' => 1481.407, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s build the heart.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita membersihkan dan membina keikhlasan hati.', 'order' => 491],
            ['start_time' => 1481.507, 'end_time' => 1482.767, 'target_text' => 'We need it for the ummah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita amat memerlukannya demi keutuhan ummah.', 'order' => 492],
            ['start_time' => 1482.867, 'end_time' => 1487.367, 'target_text' => 'We need it for the sake of Allah and the messenger of Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam.', 'source_text' => 'Kita memerlukannya demi mencari keredhaan Allah dan Rasul-Nya Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam.', 'order' => 493],
            ['start_time' => 1487.467, 'end_time' => 1488.117, 'target_text' => 'We need it.', 'source_text' => 'Kita amat memerlukannya.', 'order' => 494],
            ['start_time' => 1488.217, 'end_time' => 1489.808, 'target_text' => 'Yes, we will discuss our matters.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, kita akan sentiasa membincangkan urusan dan pandangan kita.', 'order' => 495],
            ['start_time' => 1489.908, 'end_time' => 1492.267, 'target_text' => 'We will do so respectfully.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kita akan melakukannya dengan penuh rasa hormat dan adab.', 'order' => 496],
            ['start_time' => 1492.697, 'end_time' => 1499.607, 'target_text' => 'But in the meantime, so many people are struggling on earth going back to the topic that people are leaving the deen out', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi sementara itu, begitu ramai manusia sedang menderita di muka bumi ini—kembali kepada topik asal bahawa ramai insan yang meninggalkan pegangan agama', 'order' => 497],
            ['start_time' => 1499.707, 'end_time' => 1503.928, 'target_text' => 'of hopelessness because they say that when will Allah help me?', 'source_text' => 'akibat rasa putus asa kerana mereka meratap, "Bilakah Allah akan membantu saya?', 'order' => 498],
            ['start_time' => 1504.028, 'end_time' => 1505.527, 'target_text' => 'Why is Allah doing this to me?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah Allah menguji saya seberat ini?"', 'order' => 499],
            ['start_time' => 1505.627, 'end_time' => 1507.447, 'target_text' => 'And sometimes they say this is happening.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kadangkala mereka mengeluh bahawa musibah ini terus berulang.', 'order' => 500],
            ['start_time' => 1507.547, 'end_time' => 1509.688, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve been making dua for 5 years.', 'source_text' => '"Saya telah berdoa selama 5 tahun berturut-turut.', 'order' => 501],
            ['start_time' => 1509.788, 'end_time' => 1510.327, 'target_text' => 'And you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 502],
            ['start_time' => 1510.427, 'end_time' => 1511.767, 'target_text' => 'It\'s just not happening.', 'source_text' => 'Doa itu masih belum dimakbulkan."', 'order' => 503],
            ['start_time' => 1511.867, 'end_time' => 1513.527, 'target_text' => 'Do you not trust Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Tidakkah anda yakin dan mempercayai Allah?', 'order' => 504],
            ['start_time' => 1513.627, 'end_time' => 1514.717, 'target_text' => 'Do you not trust Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda tidak menaruh kepercayaan kepada Allah?', 'order' => 505],
            ['start_time' => 1514.817, 'end_time' => 1516.327, 'target_text' => 'What did I tell you right at the beginning?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang telah saya kongsikan di awal ceramah tadi?', 'order' => 506],
            ['start_time' => 1516.427, 'end_time' => 1519.928, 'target_text' => 'You can hit the gravel one time, two times, three times, or five times.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin melanggar jalan berbatu kerikil sekali, dua kali, tiga kali, atau lima kali berturut-turut.', 'order' => 507],
            ['start_time' => 1520.028, 'end_time' => 1523.808, 'target_text' => 'Every time you hit the gravel follow the same rule.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap kali anda melalui jalan berbatu kerikil itu, patuhilah peraturan yang sama.', 'order' => 508],
            ['start_time' => 1523.908, 'end_time' => 1526.918, 'target_text' => 'If you flip it once, you\'re gone.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda melanggar peraturan walau sekali sahaja, anda akan terbabas dan binasa.', 'order' => 509],
            ['start_time' => 1527.018, 'end_time' => 1530.727, 'target_text' => 'So, if Allah keeps you in that condition for 4 years, 5 years, trust Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, jika Allah menetapkan anda dalam keadaan ujian itu selama 4 atau 5 tahun, percayalah kepada ketetapan Allah.', 'order' => 510],
            ['start_time' => 1530.827, 'end_time' => 1533.688, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, at the end of this you have something grand for me.', 'source_text' => 'Katakanlah: "Ya Allah, di penghujung ujian ini pasti Engkau telah menyediakan sesuatu ganjaran yang amat agung untukku.', 'order' => 511],
            ['start_time' => 1533.788, 'end_time' => 1535.367, 'target_text' => 'If not in this world, in the next.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya tidak di dunia fana ini, pasti di negeri akhirat kelak."', 'order' => 512],
            ['start_time' => 1535.467, 'end_time' => 1540.558, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, I know OF SO MANY EXAMPLES of people who bore patience for a year, 2 years, 3 years.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, saya mengenali BEGITU BANYAK CONTOH insan yang tabah bersabar selama setahun, dua tahun, tiga tahun.', 'order' => 513],
            ['start_time' => 1540.658, 'end_time' => 1543.688, 'target_text' => 'When they started thinking that when is the help of Allah going to come?', 'source_text' => 'Sewaktu mereka mula berfikir kapankah pertolongan Allah akan tiba?', 'order' => 514],
            ['start_time' => 1543.788, 'end_time' => 1551.487, 'target_text' => 'At some point the help of Allah came to the degree where the DOORS OF MERCY FLUNG OPEN AND THEY COULD NOT imagine that', 'source_text' => 'Pada satu detik yang tepat, pertolongan Allah tiba sehingga PINTU-PINTU RAHMAT TERBUKA LUAS SEHINGGA MEREKA TIDAK PERNAH membayangkan', 'order' => 515],
            ['start_time' => 1551.587, 'end_time' => 1553.127, 'target_text' => 'THAT WOULD HAVE EVER happened to them.', 'source_text' => 'BAHAWA KURNIAAN ITU AKAN BENAR-BENAR berlaku dalam hidup mereka.', 'order' => 516],
            ['start_time' => 1553.227, 'end_time' => 1556.127, 'target_text' => 'I know someone who\'s today a billionaire.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mengenali seseorang yang pada hari ini telah menjadi seorang bilionair.', 'order' => 517],
            ['start_time' => 1556.227, 'end_time' => 1564.288, 'target_text' => 'And there was a time when he was so hopeless and unemployed that he thought that he would actually be a homeless street', 'source_text' => 'Dan pernah ada suatu masa dahulu beliau berada dalam keadaan begitu terdesak dan menganggur sehinggakan menyangka dirinya akan menjadi gelandangan', 'order' => 518],
            ['start_time' => 1564.388, 'end_time' => 1566.188, 'target_text' => 'kid.', 'source_text' => 'di jalanan.', 'order' => 519],
            ['start_time' => 1566.537, 'end_time' => 1567.967, 'target_text' => 'Many people are very wealthy.', 'source_text' => 'Ramai orang yang sangat kaya hari ini,', 'order' => 520],
            ['start_time' => 1568.067, 'end_time' => 1571.087, 'target_text' => 'At some point in their lives, they went through zero.', 'source_text' => 'pernah berada pada titik sifar dalam hidup mereka pada suatu masa dahulu.', 'order' => 521],
            ['start_time' => 1571.187, 'end_time' => 1573.928, 'target_text' => 'And some people go up and down and up and down again.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sesetengah insan melalui fasa pasang surut kehidupan berulang kali.', 'order' => 522],
            ['start_time' => 1574.028, 'end_time' => 1579.647, 'target_text' => 'I remember there was a xenophobic attack on a on a Somali brother in Port Elizabeth.', 'source_text' => 'Saya teringat pernah berlaku satu serangan xenofobia terhadap seorang saudara Muslim Somalia di Port Elizabeth.', 'order' => 523],
            ['start_time' => 1579.747, 'end_time' => 1582.997, 'target_text' => 'I think it\'s called Rebecha at the moment, right?', 'source_text' => 'Saya rasa kini kawasan itu dikenali sebagai Gqeberha, betul bukan?', 'order' => 524],
            ['start_time' => 1583.097, 'end_time' => 1584.437, 'target_text' => 'Did I get it right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul ke sebutan saya?', 'order' => 525],
            ['start_time' => 1584.537, 'end_time' => 1584.937, 'target_text' => 'I got it right.', 'source_text' => 'Betul sebutannya.', 'order' => 526],
            ['start_time' => 1584.987, 'end_time' => 1586.437, 'target_text' => 'Okay.', 'source_text' => 'Baiklah.', 'order' => 527],
            ['start_time' => 1586.537, 'end_time' => 1589.877, 'target_text' => 'That\'s because we learned tajweed in Arabic, you know.', 'source_text' => 'Itu kerana kita belajar tajwid dalam bahasa Arab, jadi kita faham makhrajnya.', 'order' => 528],
            ['start_time' => 1589.977, 'end_time' => 1592.329, 'target_text' => 'So, we know how to pronounce the kha a little bit.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi kita tahu bagaimana membunyikan huruf kha dengan tepat.', 'order' => 529],
            ['start_time' => 1592.429, 'end_time' => 1593.649, 'target_text' => 'So, I tell you what has happened.', 'source_text' => 'Biar saya ceritakan apa yang berlaku seterusnya.', 'order' => 530],
            ['start_time' => 1593.749, 'end_time' => 1599.129, 'target_text' => 'To be honest with you, that brother lost everything and he was wealthy and they were interviewing him and I saw this interview', 'source_text' => 'Sejujurnya dengan anda, saudara itu kehilangan segala harta bendanya walhal sebelum itu beliau seorang yang kaya, dan ketika wartawan menemu ramahnya di mana saya melihat rakaman itu', 'order' => 531],
            ['start_time' => 1599.229, 'end_time' => 1603.089, 'target_text' => 'somewhere on my feed and he says, "I came from Somalia with nothing.', 'source_text' => 'di media sosial saya, beliau berkata: "Saya datang dari Somalia sehelai sepinggang tanpa apa-apa.', 'order' => 532],
            ['start_time' => 1603.189, 'end_time' => 1604.359, 'target_text' => 'We built everything.', 'source_text' => 'Kami membina segala perniagaan ini dari bawah.', 'order' => 533],
            ['start_time' => 1604.459, 'end_time' => 1605.089, 'target_text' => 'Everything went.', 'source_text' => 'Kini semuanya telah musnah terbakar.', 'order' => 534],
            ['start_time' => 1605.189, 'end_time' => 1606.609, 'target_text' => 'I had no insurance, no nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tiada perlindungan insurans, tiada apa-apa pampasan.', 'order' => 535],
            ['start_time' => 1606.709, 'end_time' => 1610.529, 'target_text' => 'I trust Allah enough that he will grant me even more than what he took away from me.', 'source_text' => 'Namun saya cukup yakin dan bertawakal kepada Allah bahawa Dia pasti akan mengurniakan kepada saya lebih banyak daripada apa yang telah diambil-Nya.', 'order' => 536],
            ['start_time' => 1610.629, 'end_time' => 1618.309, 'target_text' => 'I can start from scratch again tomorrow morning." And I\'m thinking, "That attitude is what you and I need."', 'source_text' => 'Saya mampu memulakan semula perniagaan dari awal pagi esok." Dan saya merenung, "Sikap ketabahan inilah yang amat saya dan anda perlukan."', 'order' => 537],
            ['start_time' => 1619.179, 'end_time' => 1621.359, 'target_text' => 'I say this again.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tegaskan perkara ini sekali lagi.', 'order' => 538],
            ['start_time' => 1621.459, 'end_time' => 1628.169, 'target_text' => 'If many of us here, or say a few of us here, have exactly the same problem, the same issue.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya ramai antara kita di sini, atau katakan beberapa orang antara kita di sini, ditimpa masalah dan ujian yang serupa.', 'order' => 539],
            ['start_time' => 1628.269, 'end_time' => 1629.969, 'target_text' => 'Same thing happened to you, happened to him.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara sama menimpa anda, dan perkara sama menimpa dirinya.', 'order' => 540],
            ['start_time' => 1630.069, 'end_time' => 1631.689, 'target_text' => 'Same thing happened to him, happened to her.', 'source_text' => 'Ujian yang sama dialami olehnya, dan turut dialami oleh saudari itu.', 'order' => 541],
            ['start_time' => 1631.789, 'end_time' => 1635.519, 'target_text' => 'Same thing happened to her, happened to someone there and so on.', 'source_text' => 'Ujian sama yang dilalui olehnya, turut dilalui oleh orang di sebelah sana dan seterusnya.', 'order' => 542],
            ['start_time' => 1635.619, 'end_time' => 1643.969, 'target_text' => 'Each one of them will navigate it differently based on their connection with Allah and the messenger the seerah and the', 'source_text' => 'Setiap orang akan mengharungi dan mengemudi ujian itu secara berbeza bergantung kepada tautan hubungan mereka dengan Allah, dengan Rasul, dengan sirah', 'order' => 543],
            ['start_time' => 1644.069, 'end_time' => 1648.039, 'target_text' => 'life of the prophet and his teachings the sunnah', 'source_text' => 'perjalanan hidup Nabi serta ajaran sunnah Baginda,', 'order' => 544],
            ['start_time' => 1648.139, 'end_time' => 1651.559, 'target_text' => 'and how dedicated you are to all of that.', 'source_text' => 'dan sejauh mana keikhlasan iltizam anda terhadap semua perkara tersebut.', 'order' => 545],
            ['start_time' => 1651.659, 'end_time' => 1652.289, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hakikat yang membezakannya.', 'order' => 546],
            ['start_time' => 1652.389, 'end_time' => 1653.289, 'target_text' => 'I have the same problem.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mungkin mempunyai masalah yang serupa.', 'order' => 547],
            ['start_time' => 1653.389, 'end_time' => 1654.609, 'target_text' => 'There are people who\'ve lost things.', 'source_text' => 'Ada insan yang kehilangan harta benda.', 'order' => 548],
            ['start_time' => 1654.709, 'end_time' => 1660.919, 'target_text' => 'They say, "I\'m happy with the decree of Allah." And right next door, a guy lost slightly less and he can\'t sleep.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka dengan tenang berkata, "Saya redha dengan qada dan qadar Allah." Namun jiran di sebelah yang kerugian sedikit sahaja sudah tidak lena tidur.', 'order' => 549],
            ['start_time' => 1661.019, 'end_time' => 1662.049, 'target_text' => 'It\'s like everything\'s finished.', 'source_text' => 'Baginya seolah-olah seluruh dunianya telah kiamat.', 'order' => 550],
            ['start_time' => 1662.149, 'end_time' => 1663.399, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah boleh berbeza begitu?', 'order' => 551],
            ['start_time' => 1663.499, 'end_time' => 1669.199, 'target_text' => 'Because I\'d like to think that it\'s the way you look at things.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana pada pandangan saya, ia berbalik kepada sudut pandang dan cara anda menilai sesuatu perkara.', 'order' => 552],
            ['start_time' => 1669.299, 'end_time' => 1670.889, 'target_text' => 'It\'s the way you look at things.', 'source_text' => 'Ia bergantung kepada bagaimana cara anda memandang kehidupan.', 'order' => 553],
            ['start_time' => 1670.989, 'end_time' => 1675.769, 'target_text' => 'Life is not promised to you in terms of everything you want is going to be there.', 'source_text' => 'Kehidupan di dunia ini tidak pernah menjanjikan bahawa semua impian yang anda inginkan akan tersedia ada.', 'order' => 554],
            ['start_time' => 1675.869, 'end_time' => 1677.639, 'target_text' => 'It was never there for anyone.', 'source_text' => 'Ia tidak pernah berlaku begitu kepada sesiapa pun dalam sejarah manusia.', 'order' => 555],
            ['start_time' => 1677.739, 'end_time' => 1680.169, 'target_text' => 'The prophet is the highest of all.', 'source_text' => 'Nabi Muhammad adalah insan yang paling mulia darjatnya di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 556],
            ['start_time' => 1680.269, 'end_time' => 1682.969, 'target_text' => 'He had the best given by Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Baginda dikurniakan sebaik-baik kelebihan oleh Allah.', 'order' => 557],
            ['start_time' => 1683.069, 'end_time' => 1685.799, 'target_text' => 'And like I say, the prophet', 'source_text' => 'Dan seperti yang saya katakan,', 'order' => 558],
            ['start_time' => 1685.899, 'end_time' => 1689.359, 'target_text' => 'that example is way beyond any of ours.', 'source_text' => 'teladan Baginda adalah jauh melangkaui apa jua kemampuan kita.', 'order' => 559],
            ['start_time' => 1689.459, 'end_time' => 1695.599, 'target_text' => 'Our examples are very small and slow, but we learn even from one another.', 'source_text' => 'Kisah hidup kita hanyalah cebisan kecil dan perlahan, namun kita mampu belajar daripada pengalaman sesama kita.', 'order' => 560],
            ['start_time' => 1695.699, 'end_time' => 1697.199, 'target_text' => 'We learn from one another.', 'source_text' => 'Kita saling belajar daripada saudara kita.', 'order' => 561],
            ['start_time' => 1697.299, 'end_time' => 1699.329, 'target_text' => 'To say, "They went through something.', 'source_text' => 'Untuk kita sedar, "Mereka pernah melalui kepayahan itu.', 'order' => 562],
            ['start_time' => 1699.429, 'end_time' => 1703.029, 'target_text' => 'I went through something." You know, here in Cape Town,', 'source_text' => 'Saya juga melalui kepayahan ini." Anda tahu, di Cape Town ini,', 'order' => 563],
            ['start_time' => 1703.379, 'end_time' => 1709.319, 'target_text' => 'when something happens to us, there is a tradition that is solid and correct.', 'source_text' => 'apabila sesuatu musibah menimpa kita, ada satu ungkapan tradisi masyarakat yang amat kukuh dan benar.', 'order' => 564],
            ['start_time' => 1709.419, 'end_time' => 1711.119, 'target_text' => 'They say,', 'source_text' => 'Mereka selalu berkata,', 'order' => 565],
            ['start_time' => 1711.219, 'end_time' => 1712.249, 'target_text' => '"It could have been worse.', 'source_text' => '"Keadaan ini sebenarnya boleh jadi jauh lebih buruk lagi.', 'order' => 566],
            ['start_time' => 1712.349, 'end_time' => 1715.12, 'target_text' => 'Thank Allah." Am I right or wrong?', 'source_text' => 'Bersyukurlah kepada Allah." Betul atau tidak kata-kata saya ini?', 'order' => 567],
            ['start_time' => 1715.22, 'end_time' => 1718.2, 'target_text' => 'And you think everything that happens you tell me it could have been worse.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda mungkin berfikir setiap perkara yang berlaku, anda ingatkan saya bahawa ia boleh jadi lebih teruk.', 'order' => 568],
            ['start_time' => 1718.3, 'end_time' => 1719.73, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi it could have been worse.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, ia memang boleh jadi jauh lebih buruk daripada itu.', 'order' => 569],
            ['start_time' => 1719.83, 'end_time' => 1723.72, 'target_text' => 'The day you say something else, you\'re going to start suffering.', 'source_text' => 'Pada hari anda mula merungut perkara sebaliknya, pada saat itulah anda akan mula merana sengsara.', 'order' => 570],
            ['start_time' => 1723.82, 'end_time' => 1725.4, 'target_text' => 'It could have been worse.', 'source_text' => 'Keadaan itu boleh jadi jauh lebih buruk.', 'order' => 571],
            ['start_time' => 1725.5, 'end_time' => 1726.61, 'target_text' => 'But I lost both my legs.', 'source_text' => '"Tetapi saya kehilangan kedua-dua belah kaki saya."', 'order' => 572],
            ['start_time' => 1726.71, 'end_time' => 1729.45, 'target_text' => 'Hey, there\'s another guy who lost both his legs and both his arms.', 'source_text' => 'Ketahuilah, ada orang lain yang kehilangan kedua-dua belah kaki berserta kedua-dua belah tangannya sekali.', 'order' => 573],
            ['start_time' => 1729.55, 'end_time' => 1734.88, 'target_text' => 'You say, "But I lost both my legs, both my arms." Another guy lost both his legs, both his arms, and both his eyes.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mengeluh, "Tetapi saya kehilangan kedua-dua belah kaki dan tangan saya." Ada insan lain yang kehilangan kaki, tangan, dan kedua-dua belah matanya.', 'order' => 574],
            ['start_time' => 1734.98, 'end_time' => 1737.08, 'target_text' => 'There\'s always be someone worse.', 'source_text' => 'Akan sentiasa ada insan yang menanggung nasib lebih perit berbanding anda.', 'order' => 575],
            ['start_time' => 1737.18, 'end_time' => 1746.53, 'target_text' => 'So, Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam tells us, "Look at those who are below you, who are in a worse off condition', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam berpesan kepada kita: "Lihatlah kepada orang yang berada di bawah kamu, yang keadaannya lebih susah', 'order' => 576],
            ['start_time' => 1746.63, 'end_time' => 1752.65, 'target_text' => 'than you, for you to be able to show gratitude to Allah, to be thankful to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'daripada kamu, agar kamu mampu memanjatkan rasa syukur kepada Allah dan menghargai nikmat-Nya.', 'order' => 577],
            ['start_time' => 1752.75, 'end_time' => 1760.69, 'target_text' => 'And when it comes to faith and practice and connectivity to Allah, look at those who are above you." When you look at those', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila membabitkan urusan agama, amal ibadah, dan kedekatan diri dengan Allah, lihatlah kepada mereka yang berada di atas kamu." Apabila anda melihat', 'order' => 578],
            ['start_time' => 1760.79, 'end_time' => 1766.24, 'target_text' => 'who are doing more than you, you\'re doing Tahajjud and you think, "Hey, gosh, I\'m a pious guy.', 'source_text' => 'kepada orang yang beramal lebih banyak daripada anda, sewaktu anda bangun solat Tahajjud lalu anda mula berbisik bangga, "Wah, hebatnya aku,', 'order' => 579],
            ['start_time' => 1766.34, 'end_time' => 1767.96, 'target_text' => 'I\'m holy."', 'source_text' => 'aku seorang yang sangat warak."', 'order' => 580],
            ['start_time' => 1768.06, 'end_time' => 1770.04, 'target_text' => 'Yes, there are people like this.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, memang ada orang yang bersikap sedemikian.', 'order' => 581],
            ['start_time' => 1770.14, 'end_time' => 1771.48, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan teka apa?', 'order' => 582],
            ['start_time' => 1771.58, 'end_time' => 1775.48, 'target_text' => 'There is someone who does much more than you and they\'re very humble.', 'source_text' => 'Ada insan lain yang beramal jauh lebih banyak daripada anda, namun mereka bersikap amat tawaduk dan rendah hati.', 'order' => 583],
            ['start_time' => 1775.58, 'end_time' => 1776.84, 'target_text' => 'Very humble.', 'source_text' => 'Sangat tawaduk.', 'order' => 584],
            ['start_time' => 1776.94, 'end_time' => 1777.69, 'target_text' => 'Very humble.', 'source_text' => 'Amat rendah diri.', 'order' => 585],
            ['start_time' => 1777.79, 'end_time' => 1785.37, 'target_text' => 'You know, wealth is something that mashallah many many people now and I think it\'s a sign of Qiyamah that many people', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, kekayaan harta benda adalah sesuatu yang masha Allah dimiliki oleh begitu ramai orang hari ini, dan saya rasa ia adalah tanda kiamat bahawa ramai orang', 'order' => 586],
            ['start_time' => 1785.47, 'end_time' => 1785.89, 'target_text' => 'will be wealthy.', 'source_text' => 'akan menjadi kaya-raya.', 'order' => 587],
            ['start_time' => 1785.99, 'end_time' => 1790.93, 'target_text' => 'In fact, almost all people will be wealthy to the degree where one of the narrations of Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi', 'source_text' => 'Malah, hampir kesemua orang akan berada dalam kelapangan harta sehingga dalam salah satu hadis Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi', 'order' => 588],
            ['start_time' => 1791.03, 'end_time' => 1795.73, 'target_text' => 'Wasallam he says it will become difficult for people to give zakat, to find someone to give their zakat to.', 'source_text' => 'Wasallam, Baginda bersabda bahawa akan tiba suatu masa di mana manusia sukar untuk mencari asnaf yang layak menerima zakat mereka.', 'order' => 589],
            ['start_time' => 1795.83, 'end_time' => 1801.28, 'target_text' => 'Imagine I\'m going with 150,000 rands and I and I and I\'m giving a person and say, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan saya membawa wang 150,000 Rand untuk diagihkan kepada seseorang lalu berkata, "Tahukah anda,', 'order' => 590],
            ['start_time' => 1801.38, 'end_time' => 1804.92, 'target_text' => 'Uh this is zakat." They say, "What are you talking about?"', 'source_text' => 'wang ini adalah zakat." Mereka akan menjawab, "Apa yang anda merepekkan ini?', 'order' => 591],
            ['start_time' => 1805.02, 'end_time' => 1807.0, 'target_text' => 'I\'m a billionaire.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sendiri seorang bilionair.', 'order' => 592],
            ['start_time' => 1807.1, 'end_time' => 1808.88, 'target_text' => 'I\'m a millionaire, whatever it might be.', 'source_text' => 'Saya seorang jutawan, atau apa jua tarafnya."', 'order' => 593],
            ['start_time' => 1808.98, 'end_time' => 1812.36, 'target_text' => 'I remember something on a lighter note, but it\'s true, it happened in Cape Town.', 'source_text' => 'Saya teringat satu kisah santai, namun ia adalah benar dan berlaku di Cape Town ini.', 'order' => 594],
            ['start_time' => 1812.46, 'end_time' => 1816.89, 'target_text' => 'I gave a talk here years ago and I was mentioning this sign of Qiyamah that everybody will be rich.', 'source_text' => 'Saya menyampaikan ceramah di sini bertahun-tahun dahulu dan saya menyebutkan tanda hari kiamat ini bahawa semua orang akan menjadi kaya.', 'order' => 595],
            ['start_time' => 1816.99, 'end_time' => 1821.6, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, after the talk two three youngsters came to me, "When is the time going to come?"', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, selepas tamat ceramah, dua tiga orang anak muda datang menghampiri saya dan bertanya, "Bila masanya waktu itu nak sampai ustaz?"', 'order' => 596],
            ['start_time' => 1821.7, 'end_time' => 1827.53, 'target_text' => 'In my mind I said, "Oh, only in Cape Town." >> [laughter] >> Because people struggle, so they want to know when is it', 'source_text' => 'Dalam hati saya berkata, "Aduhai, hanya di Cape Town soalan begini ditanya." Kerana orang ramai sedang susah, jadi mereka mahu tahu bilakah masa kaya itu', 'order' => 597],
            ['start_time' => 1827.63, 'end_time' => 1828.76, 'target_text' => 'going to come.', 'source_text' => 'akan tiba.', 'order' => 598],
            ['start_time' => 1828.86, 'end_time' => 1829.89, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 599],
            ['start_time' => 1829.99, 'end_time' => 1836.892, 'target_text' => 'But anyway, the point I was raising is there are people sometimes who have so much and we think we made Tahajjud and we', 'source_text' => 'Namun perkara pokok yang ingin saya tekankan ialah kadangkala ada orang yang memiliki kekayaan melimpah-ruah, dan sewaktu kita bangun Tahajjud kita merasa', 'order' => 600],
            ['start_time' => 1836.992, 'end_time' => 1841.522, 'target_text' => 'think we are pious, we think we are doing they are doing more than us and they are humble.', 'source_text' => 'sangka kita alim, kita sangka kita beramal, padahal mereka beramal lebih banyak daripada kita dan mereka sangat tawaduk.', 'order' => 601],
            ['start_time' => 1841.622, 'end_time' => 1843.602, 'target_text' => 'No one notices.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada siapa yang perasan.', 'order' => 602],
            ['start_time' => 1843.702, 'end_time' => 1849.802, 'target_text' => 'I went to Nigeria and I give you the example of Nigeria because it\'s one of my one of my favorite places.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah pergi ke Nigeria dan saya beri anda contoh Nigeria kerana ia adalah salah satu tempat kegemaran saya.', 'order' => 603],
            ['start_time' => 1849.902, 'end_time' => 1858.012, 'target_text' => 'And I met people who you would never ever believe this guy is one of the wealthiest guys in the world.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya bertemu dengan orang-orang yang anda tidak akan percaya bahawa orang ini adalah antara individu terkaya di dunia.', 'order' => 604],
            ['start_time' => 1858.112, 'end_time' => 1860.842, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi al-Azim, they won\'t compromise salah.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah Yang Maha Agung, mereka tidak akan sesekali berkompromi tentang solat.', 'order' => 605],
            ['start_time' => 1860.942, 'end_time' => 1861.492, 'target_text' => 'Never.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak sama sekali.', 'order' => 606],
            ['start_time' => 1861.592, 'end_time' => 1862.842, 'target_text' => 'No chance.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada peluang untuk culas.', 'order' => 607],
            ['start_time' => 1862.942, 'end_time' => 1864.162, 'target_text' => 'Never.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak sekali-kali.', 'order' => 608],
            ['start_time' => 1864.262, 'end_time' => 1865.212, 'target_text' => 'No compromise.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada kompromi.', 'order' => 609],
            ['start_time' => 1865.312, 'end_time' => 1868.452, 'target_text' => 'I remember a guy five salah and the man is there.', 'source_text' => 'Saya teringat seorang lelaki, lima waktu solat lelaki itu sentiasa berada di situ.', 'order' => 610],
            ['start_time' => 1868.552, 'end_time' => 1875.692, 'target_text' => 'I entered into the Okay, I don\'t want to mention specifics but I went to do salatul Fajr and I was early because I couldn\'t', 'source_text' => 'Saya masuk ke dalam... Baiklah, saya tidak mahu sebut secara terperinci, tetapi saya pergi untuk solat Subuh dan saya datang awal kerana saya tidak dapat', 'order' => 611],
            ['start_time' => 1875.792, 'end_time' => 1880.682, 'target_text' => 'sleep time zones and whatever and I thought let me go into the masjid before the adhan of Fajr.', 'source_text' => 'tidur akibat perbezaan zon masa dan sebagainya, jadi saya fikir lebih baik saya masuk ke masjid sebelum azan Subuh berkumandang.', 'order' => 612],
            ['start_time' => 1880.782, 'end_time' => 1882.762, 'target_text' => 'Before the adhan of Fajr.', 'source_text' => 'Sebelum azan Subuh lagi.', 'order' => 613],
            ['start_time' => 1882.862, 'end_time' => 1885.842, 'target_text' => 'And I checked the masjid was packed.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila saya lihat, masjid sudah pun penuh sesak.', 'order' => 614],
            ['start_time' => 1885.942, 'end_time' => 1888.162, 'target_text' => 'So I thought, what\'s going on here?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi saya terfikir, apa yang sedang berlaku di sini?', 'order' => 615],
            ['start_time' => 1888.262, 'end_time' => 1896.031, 'target_text' => 'Astaghfirullah, for a moment shaitan made me think did someone tell them Mufti Menk is coming here?', 'source_text' => 'Astaghfirullah, seketika syaitan membuatkan saya terfikir, adakah sesiapa memberitahu mereka bahawa Mufti Menk akan datang ke sini?', 'order' => 616],
            ['start_time' => 1896.142, 'end_time' => 1898.212, 'target_text' => 'Astaghfirullah, la hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'source_text' => 'Astaghfirullah, la hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'order' => 617],
            ['start_time' => 1898.312, 'end_time' => 1899.121, 'target_text' => 'And we are nobodies.', 'source_text' => 'Sedangkan kita ini bukan sesiapa pun.', 'order' => 618],
            ['start_time' => 1899.221, 'end_time' => 1900.652, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, we are nobodies.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, kita ini bukan sesiapa.', 'order' => 619],
            ['start_time' => 1900.752, 'end_time' => 1905.652, 'target_text' => 'We are not even equivalent to the We are not even equivalent to the weight of a wing of a fly.', 'source_text' => 'Kita bahkan tidak setaraf dengan... Kita bahkan tidak setaraf dengan berat sebelah sayap lalat.', 'order' => 620],
            ['start_time' => 1905.752, 'end_time' => 1910.692, 'target_text' => 'May Allah accept the little things we did and mistakes we\'ve made in our lives.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah menerima amalan kecil yang kita lakukan dan memaafkan kesilapan yang pernah kita lakukan dalam hidup kita.', 'order' => 621],
            ['start_time' => 1910.792, 'end_time' => 1912.402, 'target_text' => 'May Allah forgive us for them.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengampuni kita atas dosa-dosa itu.', 'order' => 622],
            ['start_time' => 1912.502, 'end_time' => 1916.722, 'target_text' => 'But I tell you and they told me no, it\'s like this every day.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya beritahu anda, dan mereka memberitahu saya, tidak, keadaannya memang begini setiap hari.', 'order' => 623],
            ['start_time' => 1916.822, 'end_time' => 1919.162, 'target_text' => 'It\'s like this every day.', 'source_text' => 'Memang begini setiap hari.', 'order' => 624],
            ['start_time' => 1919.262, 'end_time' => 1922.282, 'target_text' => 'And you think YOU GOT HOLY PEOPLE HERE?', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda sangka ADA ORANG ALIM DI SINI?', 'order' => 625],
            ['start_time' => 1922.382, 'end_time' => 1927.472, 'target_text' => 'FAJR SALAH IS ONE SAF, QUARTER SAF AND THAT ALSO HALF THE GUYS ARE', 'source_text' => 'SOLAT SUBUH CUMA SATU SAF, SUKU SAF, DAN ITU PUN SEPARUH DARIPADANYA DUDUK DI...', 'order' => 626],
            ['start_time' => 1927.782, 'end_time' => 1928.892, 'target_text' => 'ANYWAY, Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'APA-APA PUN, Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 627],
            ['start_time' => 1928.992, 'end_time' => 1931.642, 'target_text' => 'May Allah make us steadfast with Fajr.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah menjadikan kita istiqamah dalam solat Subuh.', 'order' => 628],
            ['start_time' => 1931.742, 'end_time' => 1937.532, 'target_text' => 'There is a narration that states when the Isha and the Fajr are choking, your problems of the ummah will begin to become', 'source_text' => 'Ada sebuah riwayat yang menyatakan apabila solat Isyak dan Subuh dipenuhi jemaah, masalah-masalah ummah akan mula', 'order' => 629],
            ['start_time' => 1937.632, 'end_time' => 1940.292, 'target_text' => 'resolved inshallah by the will of Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala.', 'source_text' => 'diselesaikan insya-Allah dengan izin Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala.', 'order' => 630],
            ['start_time' => 1940.392, 'end_time' => 1942.012, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kita kemudahan.', 'order' => 631],
            ['start_time' => 1942.112, 'end_time' => 1944.012, 'target_text' => 'So my brothers and sisters, don\'t lose hope.', 'source_text' => 'Maka saudara-saudariku, jangan berputus asa.', 'order' => 632],
            ['start_time' => 1944.112, 'end_time' => 1944.932, 'target_text' => 'You think you\'re struggling?', 'source_text' => 'Anda sangka anda seorang sahaja yang bergelut?', 'order' => 633],
            ['start_time' => 1945.032, 'end_time' => 1946.012, 'target_text' => 'The whole world is struggling.', 'source_text' => 'Satu dunia sedang bergelut.', 'order' => 634],
            ['start_time' => 1946.112, 'end_time' => 1949.512, 'target_text' => 'I remember I went home recently, Zimbabwe.', 'source_text' => 'Saya teringat baru-baru ini saya pulang ke tanah air, Zimbabwe.', 'order' => 635],
            ['start_time' => 1949.902, 'end_time' => 1951.922, 'target_text' => 'Fuel price $2.06.', 'source_text' => 'Harga bahan api 2.06 dolar.', 'order' => 636],
            ['start_time' => 1952.022, 'end_time' => 1953.052, 'target_text' => 'I got a shock of my life.', 'source_text' => 'Saya terkejut besar seumur hidup saya.', 'order' => 637],
            ['start_time' => 1953.152, 'end_time' => 1954.452, 'target_text' => 'I told the brother, what?', 'source_text' => 'Saya kata kepada saudara itu, apa?', 'order' => 638],
            ['start_time' => 1954.552, 'end_time' => 1956.352, 'target_text' => '$2.06?', 'source_text' => '2.06 dolar?', 'order' => 639],
            ['start_time' => 1956.542, 'end_time' => 1957.642, 'target_text' => 'He says, yeah.', 'source_text' => 'Dia menjawab, ya.', 'order' => 640],
            ['start_time' => 1957.742, 'end_time' => 1958.371, 'target_text' => 'Life is tough.', 'source_text' => 'Hidup ini susah.', 'order' => 641],
            ['start_time' => 1958.471, 'end_time' => 1959.131, 'target_text' => 'See this country?', 'source_text' => 'Lihat negara ini?', 'order' => 642],
            ['start_time' => 1959.231, 'end_time' => 1961.893, 'target_text' => 'They sent it to the dogs." And he started rattling his things.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka telah memusnahkannya." Dan dia mula meluahkan rasa marahnya.', 'order' => 643],
            ['start_time' => 1961.993, 'end_time' => 1966.613, 'target_text' => 'I said, "Brother, the price of fuel has gone up across the globe, not just here.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berkata, "Saudara, harga minyak telah naik di seluruh dunia, bukan di sini sahaja.', 'order' => 644],
            ['start_time' => 1966.713, 'end_time' => 1969.933, 'target_text' => 'So, if this is the attitude, everyone is complaining everywhere in the world.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi jika begini sikapnya, semua orang di serata dunia sedang merungut.', 'order' => 645],
            ['start_time' => 1970.033, 'end_time' => 1973.793, 'target_text' => 'Everyone is But the price of fuel has gone up."', 'source_text' => 'Semua orang sedang... Tetapi harga minyak memang telah meningkat naik."', 'order' => 646],
            ['start_time' => 1974.143, 'end_time' => 1977.013, 'target_text' => 'The fools who decided to attack Iran caused it.', 'source_text' => 'Orang-orang bodoh yang membuat keputusan untuk menyerang Iran itulah puncanya.', 'order' => 647],
            ['start_time' => 1977.113, 'end_time' => 1978.093, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s not play games.', 'source_text' => 'Janganlah kita berdolak-dalih.', 'order' => 648],
            ['start_time' => 1978.193, 'end_time' => 1979.053, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s not lie about it.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan kita berbohong mengenainya.', 'order' => 649],
            ['start_time' => 1979.153, 'end_time' => 1980.563, 'target_text' => 'They caused it.', 'source_text' => 'Merekalah puncanya.', 'order' => 650],
            ['start_time' => 1980.663, 'end_time' => 1982.763, 'target_text' => 'Yes, it\'s a fact of life.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, ini hakikat kehidupan.', 'order' => 651],
            ['start_time' => 1982.863, 'end_time' => 1987.803, 'target_text' => 'They need to be sued by the international world', 'source_text' => 'Mereka sepatutnya disaman oleh masyarakat antarabangsa', 'order' => 652],
            ['start_time' => 1987.903, 'end_time' => 1996.523, 'target_text' => 'for raising prices across the globe and creating disaster for all of us across the world BY DOING SOMETHING EVERYONE on', 'source_text' => 'kerana menaikkan harga di seluruh dunia dan menimbulkan bencana bagi kita semua di serata dunia DENGAN MELAKUKAN SESUATU YANG SEMUA ORANG di', 'order' => 653],
            ['start_time' => 1996.623, 'end_time' => 1999.373, 'target_text' => 'the globe told them DO NOT DO IT, AND THEY DID IT.', 'source_text' => 'dunia telah memberitahu mereka JANGAN BUAT, TETAPI MEREKA TETAP MEMBUATNYA.', 'order' => 654],
            ['start_time' => 1999.473, 'end_time' => 2001.443, 'target_text' => 'MAY ALLAH Almighty', 'source_text' => 'SEMOGA ALLAH Yang Maha Berkuasa', 'order' => 655],
            ['start_time' => 2001.543, 'end_time' => 2003.643, 'target_text' => 'give them what they deserve.', 'source_text' => 'memberikan balasan setimpal kepada mereka.', 'order' => 656],
            ['start_time' => 2003.743, 'end_time' => 2010.653, 'target_text' => 'You are suffering and I am because those idiots decided to do something that wallahi the globe told them not to.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menderita dan saya juga menderita kerana orang-orang bodoh itu memutuskan untuk melakukan sesuatu yang demi Allah telah ditegah oleh satu dunia.', 'order' => 657],
            ['start_time' => 2010.753, 'end_time' => 2011.693, 'target_text' => 'They did it for fun.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka melakukannya sesuka hati.', 'order' => 658],
            ['start_time' => 2011.793, 'end_time' => 2012.613, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what they did it for.', 'source_text' => 'Untuk tujuan itulah mereka melakukannya.', 'order' => 659],
            ['start_time' => 2012.713, 'end_time' => 2013.653, 'target_text' => 'There was no threat.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sebarang ancaman pun.', 'order' => 660],
            ['start_time' => 2013.753, 'end_time' => 2015.953, 'target_text' => 'There was no nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa-apa pun langsung.', 'order' => 661],
            ['start_time' => 2016.263, 'end_time' => 2018.413, 'target_text' => 'Provoked for no reason.', 'source_text' => 'Memprovokasi tanpa sebarang sebab.', 'order' => 662],
            ['start_time' => 2018.513, 'end_time' => 2020.673, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan teka apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 663],
            ['start_time' => 2021.743, 'end_time' => 2024.273, 'target_text' => 'They were slapped back.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka telah ditampar kembali.', 'order' => 664],
            ['start_time' => 2024.463, 'end_time' => 2026.403, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us strength.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kita kekuatan.', 'order' => 665],
            ['start_time' => 2026.503, 'end_time' => 2027.813, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, we are weak.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, kita ini lemah.', 'order' => 666],
            ['start_time' => 2027.913, 'end_time' => 2031.003, 'target_text' => 'We need to be together as an ummah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mesti bersatu teguh sebagai satu ummah.', 'order' => 667],
            ['start_time' => 2031.103, 'end_time' => 2038.493, 'target_text' => 'And I\'m not a political analyst or a commentator on political affairs, but I am a I\'m a member of the global community', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya bukan seorang penganalisis politik atau pengulas hal ehwal politik, tetapi saya... saya adalah sebahagian daripada masyarakat dunia', 'order' => 668],
            ['start_time' => 2038.593, 'end_time' => 2041.093, 'target_text' => 'and a human being who lives on earth at this time.', 'source_text' => 'dan seorang insan yang hidup di muka bumi pada zaman ini.', 'order' => 669],
            ['start_time' => 2041.193, 'end_time' => 2042.293, 'target_text' => 'So, we observe.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, kita memerhati.', 'order' => 670],
            ['start_time' => 2042.393, 'end_time' => 2043.293, 'target_text' => 'We are not stupid.', 'source_text' => 'Kita bukannya bodoh.', 'order' => 671],
            ['start_time' => 2043.393, 'end_time' => 2044.533, 'target_text' => 'We watch and we see.', 'source_text' => 'Kita memantau dan kita melihat.', 'order' => 672],
            ['start_time' => 2044.633, 'end_time' => 2046.693, 'target_text' => 'And we are also, inshallah, fair-minded.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita juga, insya-Allah, berfikiran adil dan saksama.', 'order' => 673],
            ['start_time' => 2046.793, 'end_time' => 2049.093, 'target_text' => 'And we also correct ourselves when we are wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita juga memperbetulkan diri kita sendiri apabila kita salah.', 'order' => 674],
            ['start_time' => 2049.193, 'end_time' => 2055.393, 'target_text' => 'And we also try our best to contribute not just to the ummah, but to humanity at large and beyond.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita juga berusaha sedaya upaya untuk menyumbang bukan sahaja kepada ummah, malah kepada seluruh kemanusiaan sejagat.', 'order' => 675],
            ['start_time' => 2055.903, 'end_time' => 2057.693, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty forgive us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengampuni kita.', 'order' => 676],
            ['start_time' => 2057.793, 'end_time' => 2059.213, 'target_text' => 'May he grant us strength.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Dia mengurniakan kita kekuatan.', 'order' => 677],
            ['start_time' => 2059.313, 'end_time' => 2063.413, 'target_text' => 'And may Allah Almighty truly uplift us because we have a few struggles.', 'source_text' => 'Dan semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa benar-benar mengangkat darjat kita kerana kita menghadapi beberapa cabaran.', 'order' => 678],
            ['start_time' => 2063.513, 'end_time' => 2064.853, 'target_text' => 'And I want to end on this note.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya ingin mengakhiri tazkirah ini dengan perkara ini.', 'order' => 679],
            ['start_time' => 2064.953, 'end_time' => 2067.733, 'target_text' => 'Number one, we have struggles across the the globe.', 'source_text' => 'Pertama, kita menghadapi kesusahan di seluruh pelosok dunia.', 'order' => 680],
            ['start_time' => 2067.833, 'end_time' => 2074.693, 'target_text' => 'Like I was saying, the global situation is the most volatile it ever was that I\'ve known in my life.', 'source_text' => 'Seperti yang saya katakan, situasi dunia kini adalah yang paling bergolak pernah saya saksikan sepanjang hidup saya.', 'order' => 681],
            ['start_time' => 2074.793, 'end_time' => 2077.633, 'target_text' => 'And I\'m 52 years old.', 'source_text' => 'Dan umur saya kini 52 tahun.', 'order' => 682],
            ['start_time' => 2077.783, 'end_time' => 2079.923, 'target_text' => 'And I can tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya boleh beritahu anda sesuatu perkara.', 'order' => 683],
            ['start_time' => 2080.023, 'end_time' => 2084.394, 'target_text' => 'It\'s so volatile that you never know what might happen tonight.', 'source_text' => 'Keadaan begitu bergolak sehinggakan anda tidak tahu apa yang mungkin berlaku malam ini.', 'order' => 684],
            ['start_time' => 2084.984, 'end_time' => 2089.654, 'target_text' => 'We heard just now as I was entering a shooting that happened in Carletonville.', 'source_text' => 'Baru sebentar tadi sewaktu saya melangkah masuk, kita mendengar mengenai insiden tembakan yang berlaku di Carletonville.', 'order' => 685],
            ['start_time' => 2089.754, 'end_time' => 2092.524, 'target_text' => 'Did you read about it earlier today?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda membaca mengenainya awal hari ini?', 'order' => 686],
            ['start_time' => 2092.624, 'end_time' => 2093.894, 'target_text' => 'Almost 30 people shot dead.', 'source_text' => 'Hampir 30 orang mati ditembak.', 'order' => 687],
            ['start_time' => 2093.994, 'end_time' => 2094.393, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Kenapa?', 'order' => 688],
            ['start_time' => 2094.394, 'end_time' => 2095.164, 'target_text' => 'How?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana?', 'order' => 689],
            ['start_time' => 2095.264, 'end_time' => 2095.854, 'target_text' => 'Barbaric.', 'source_text' => 'Sangat biadab dan kejam.', 'order' => 690],
            ['start_time' => 2095.954, 'end_time' => 2097.654, 'target_text' => 'No matter what, it\'s condemned.', 'source_text' => 'Walau apa pun alasannya, ia mesti dikutuk sekeras-kerasnya.', 'order' => 691],
            ['start_time' => 2097.754, 'end_time' => 2099.324, 'target_text' => 'We condemn it.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mengutuknya.', 'order' => 692],
            ['start_time' => 2099.424, 'end_time' => 2101.484, 'target_text' => 'What about 30,000', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pula dengan 30,000', 'order' => 693],
            ['start_time' => 2101.584, 'end_time' => 2103.554, 'target_text' => 'and 300,000', 'source_text' => 'dan 300,000', 'order' => 694],
            ['start_time' => 2103.704, 'end_time' => 2106.324, 'target_text' => 'of our brothers and sisters in Gaza?', 'source_text' => 'saudara dan saudari kita di Gaza?', 'order' => 695],
            ['start_time' => 2106.424, 'end_time' => 2109.564, 'target_text' => 'That condemnation, hello, where is it?', 'source_text' => 'Kutukan itu, helo, ke mana hilangnya?', 'order' => 696],
            ['start_time' => 2109.664, 'end_time' => 2114.514, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant the ummah victory.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kemenangan kepada ummah.', 'order' => 697],
            ['start_time' => 2115.464, 'end_time' => 2119.414, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, it pains us to see 30 guys and rightly so.', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, hati kita terluka melihat 30 orang itu dan sememangnya wajar begitu.', 'order' => 698],
            ['start_time' => 2119.514, 'end_time' => 2120.254, 'target_text' => 'We are hurt.', 'source_text' => 'Kita berasa pedih.', 'order' => 699],
            ['start_time' => 2120.354, 'end_time' => 2121.294, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t want it to happen.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak mahu perkara sebegitu berlaku.', 'order' => 700],
            ['start_time' => 2121.394, 'end_time' => 2122.214, 'target_text' => 'It\'s our nation.', 'source_text' => 'Ini negara kita.', 'order' => 701],
            ['start_time' => 2122.314, 'end_time' => 2127.484, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t want to compromise the peace and stability and we will never do anything that compromises the peace and stability', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak mahu menggugat keamanan dan kestabilan, dan kita tidak akan sekali-kali melakukan apa-apa yang menjejaskan keamanan dan kestabilan', 'order' => 702],
            ['start_time' => 2127.584, 'end_time' => 2128.414, 'target_text' => 'of our countries.', 'source_text' => 'negara-negara kita.', 'order' => 703],
            ['start_time' => 2128.514, 'end_time' => 2131.124, 'target_text' => 'We will continue to educate the people and to help them.', 'source_text' => 'Kita akan terus mendidik masyarakat dan membantu mereka.', 'order' => 704],
            ['start_time' => 2131.224, 'end_time' => 2134.454, 'target_text' => 'Look at what we\'re talking about today, respecting each other, living with each other.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah apa yang kita bincangkan hari ini, saling menghormati antara satu sama lain, hidup bersama secara harmoni.', 'order' => 705],
            ['start_time' => 2134.554, 'end_time' => 2136.004, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t want to create problems.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak mahu mencetuskan masalah.', 'order' => 706],
            ['start_time' => 2136.104, 'end_time' => 2139.854, 'target_text' => 'We need harmony, but at the same time we want a global harmony.', 'source_text' => 'Kita memerlukan keharmonian, tetapi pada masa yang sama kita mendambakan keharmonian sejagat.', 'order' => 707],
            ['start_time' => 2139.954, 'end_time' => 2144.884, 'target_text' => 'And it must it is achievable by justice, equitable terms.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ia boleh... ia boleh dicapai melalui keadilan dan kesaksamaan.', 'order' => 708],
            ['start_time' => 2144.984, 'end_time' => 2146.174, 'target_text' => 'The problem is there\'s no justice.', 'source_text' => 'Masalahnya ialah tiada keadilan.', 'order' => 709],
            ['start_time' => 2146.274, 'end_time' => 2148.194, 'target_text' => 'It\'s one-sided.', 'source_text' => 'Ia berat sebelah.', 'order' => 710],
            ['start_time' => 2148.624, 'end_time' => 2150.994, 'target_text' => 'Completely one-sided.', 'source_text' => 'Benar-benar berat sebelah.', 'order' => 711],
            ['start_time' => 2152.024, 'end_time' => 2154.214, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us his own one hand.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kita pertolongan-Nya; di satu pihak,', 'order' => 712],
            ['start_time' => 2154.314, 'end_time' => 2159.894, 'target_text' => 'We have the ummah\'s problems and the other hand every one of us has our own problems.', 'source_text' => 'kita menghadapi masalah ummah, dan di pihak yang lain setiap daripada kita mempunyai masalah peribadi masing-masing.', 'order' => 713],
            ['start_time' => 2159.994, 'end_time' => 2164.374, 'target_text' => 'I\'m struggling with a job, for example, to make ends meet I\'m struggling.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sedang bergelut mencari pekerjaan, contohnya, untuk mencukupkan keperluan harian saya bergelut.', 'order' => 714],
            ['start_time' => 2164.474, 'end_time' => 2170.774, 'target_text' => 'You know, people were saying, "Why do you charge to have your programs?" Brother, sister, right now you\'re watching live.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, ada orang berkata, "Mengapa anda mengenakan bayaran untuk program anda?" Saudara, saudari, sekarang anda sedang menonton secara langsung.', 'order' => 715],
            ['start_time' => 2170.874, 'end_time' => 2171.494, 'target_text' => 'Guess where?', 'source_text' => 'Teka di mana?', 'order' => 716],
            ['start_time' => 2171.594, 'end_time' => 2172.374, 'target_text' => 'On a live stream.', 'source_text' => 'Melalui siaran langsung.', 'order' => 717],
            ['start_time' => 2172.474, 'end_time' => 2174.404, 'target_text' => 'It\'s totally free.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah percuma sepenuhnya.', 'order' => 718],
            ['start_time' => 2174.504, 'end_time' => 2175.254, 'target_text' => 'Totally free.', 'source_text' => 'Percuma sepenuhnya.', 'order' => 719],
            ['start_time' => 2175.354, 'end_time' => 2176.734, 'target_text' => 'Why don\'t you talk about that?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa anda tidak memperkatakan tentang hal itu?', 'order' => 720],
            ['start_time' => 2176.834, 'end_time' => 2182.934, 'target_text' => 'Why don\'t you talk about anyone who sent us an email saying I can\'t afford it, they were sent a complimentary ticket, including', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa anda tidak ceritakan tentang sesiapa yang menghantar emel menyatakan tidak mampu, mereka telah dihantar tiket percuma, termasuklah', 'order' => 721],
            ['start_time' => 2183.034, 'end_time' => 2187.534, 'target_text' => '30 from a certain girls\' madrasa who said, "You know what?', 'source_text' => '30 orang pelajar dari sebuah madrasah perempuan yang berkata, "Tahukah anda?', 'order' => 722],
            ['start_time' => 2187.634, 'end_time' => 2190.454, 'target_text' => 'We want to bring in the students and we can\'t afford it." By all means, come.', 'source_text' => 'Kami mahu membawa para pelajar kami tetapi kami tidak mampu." Dengan senang hati, jemputlah datang.', 'order' => 723],
            ['start_time' => 2190.554, 'end_time' => 2192.254, 'target_text' => 'So, we know what we\'re doing.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kami tahu apa yang kami lakukan.', 'order' => 724],
            ['start_time' => 2192.354, 'end_time' => 2198.534, 'target_text' => 'And at the same time we want you to contribute a little bit towards this beautiful venue that we have so that Allah can', 'source_text' => 'Dan pada masa yang sama kami mahu anda menyumbang sedikit untuk dewan yang indah ini agar Allah dapat', 'order' => 725],
            ['start_time' => 2198.634, 'end_time' => 2200.614, 'target_text' => 'make it a means of sadaqa jariya for you.', 'source_text' => 'menjadikannya sebagai asbab sedekah jariah untuk anda.', 'order' => 726],
            ['start_time' => 2200.714, 'end_time' => 2203.294, 'target_text' => 'It might be YOUR ENTRY INTO PARADISE.', 'source_text' => 'Ia mungkin menjadi TIKET KEMASUKAN ANDA KE SYURGA.', 'order' => 727],
            ['start_time' => 2203.394, 'end_time' => 2206.126, 'target_text' => 'IT MIGHT be your entry into paradise.', 'source_text' => 'IA MUNGKIN menjadi tiket kemasukan anda ke syurga.', 'order' => 728],
            ['start_time' => 2206.226, 'end_time' => 2207.526, 'target_text' => 'So, why not?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, mengapa tidak?', 'order' => 729],
            ['start_time' => 2207.626, 'end_time' => 2210.886, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t worry, but we know people are struggling.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan bimbang, kami sedar ramai orang sedang bergelut.', 'order' => 730],
            ['start_time' => 2210.986, 'end_time' => 2212.376, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t have jobs.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tiada pekerjaan.', 'order' => 731],
            ['start_time' => 2212.476, 'end_time' => 2213.656, 'target_text' => 'They can\'t get married.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka belum mampu berkahwin.', 'order' => 732],
            ['start_time' => 2213.756, 'end_time' => 2215.096, 'target_text' => 'They have marital issues.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menghadapi masalah rumah tangga.', 'order' => 733],
            ['start_time' => 2215.196, 'end_time' => 2223.336, 'target_text' => 'There drugs that are being carefully promoted in the midst of our children in order to make them cabbages and worthless.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat dadah yang sengaja dipromosikan di kalangan anak-anak kita untuk menjadikan mereka lemah dan tidak berguna.', 'order' => 734],
            ['start_time' => 2223.436, 'end_time' => 2229.536, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s why the plot and the ploy of peddling pornography and drugs and vices and gambling and whatever else it may', 'source_text' => 'Dan itulah sebabnya rancangan jahat menyebarkan pornografi, dadah, maksiat, perjudian dan apa jua perkara lain,', 'order' => 735],
            ['start_time' => 2229.636, 'end_time' => 2231.976, 'target_text' => 'be and clubbing and whatever else it may be.', 'source_text' => 'hiburan kelab malam dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 736],
            ['start_time' => 2232.076, 'end_time' => 2237.366, 'target_text' => 'That is at times calculated and aimed directly at us and our offspring.', 'source_text' => 'Semua itu kadang-kadang dirancang dengan teliti dan disasarkan terus kepada kita serta anak keturunan kita.', 'order' => 737],
            ['start_time' => 2237.466, 'end_time' => 2238.536, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be fooled.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan terpedaya.', 'order' => 738],
            ['start_time' => 2238.636, 'end_time' => 2239.616, 'target_text' => 'Those are not good things.', 'source_text' => 'Itu semua bukanlah perkara yang baik.', 'order' => 739],
            ['start_time' => 2239.716, 'end_time' => 2240.856, 'target_text' => 'They\'re not good habits.', 'source_text' => 'Ia bukan tabiat yang elok.', 'order' => 740],
            ['start_time' => 2240.956, 'end_time' => 2241.536, 'target_text' => 'Protect yourself.', 'source_text' => 'Peliharalah diri anda.', 'order' => 741],
            ['start_time' => 2241.636, 'end_time' => 2248.576, 'target_text' => 'If I see a young man or a young woman and they\'ve grown to the age of about 25, 26 and they\'ve managed by the help of Allah', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya melihat seorang pemuda atau pemudi yang meningkat ke usia sekitar 25, 26 tahun dan dengan pertolongan Allah mereka berjaya', 'order' => 742],
            ['start_time' => 2248.676, 'end_time' => 2253.416, 'target_text' => 'to stay away from some of these vices, wallahi it\'s a big achievement, a very big achievement.', 'source_text' => 'menjauhi maksiat-maksiat ini, demi Allah ia merupakan suatu kejayaan yang besar, kejayaan yang sangat besar.', 'order' => 743],
            ['start_time' => 2253.516, 'end_time' => 2255.016, 'target_text' => 'I\'m proud of you, young lad.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bangga dengan anda, wahai anak muda.', 'order' => 744],
            ['start_time' => 2255.116, 'end_time' => 2255.896, 'target_text' => 'Very proud of you.', 'source_text' => 'Sangat berbangga dengan anda.', 'order' => 745],
            ['start_time' => 2255.996, 'end_time' => 2256.976, 'target_text' => 'But I failed in school.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya gagal dalam pelajaran di sekolah.', 'order' => 746],
            ['start_time' => 2257.076, 'end_time' => 2258.416, 'target_text' => 'You could have failed 10 times.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin gagal 10 kali sekalipun.', 'order' => 747],
            ['start_time' => 2258.516, 'end_time' => 2264.416, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the point of having a guy who got straight A\'s and he\'s on cocaine every day and he\'s doing whatever he is with', 'source_text' => 'Apa gunanya seseorang mendapat semua A tetapi mengambil kokain setiap hari dan melakukan apa sahaja keburukan', 'order' => 748],
            ['start_time' => 2264.516, 'end_time' => 2266.536, 'target_text' => 'whatever he\'s doing in terms of negativity.', 'source_text' => 'dari segi perkara-perkara yang negatif.', 'order' => 749],
            ['start_time' => 2266.636, 'end_time' => 2271.526, 'target_text' => 'I\'d rather have someone who was dumb and failed in school and they straight and they respect us and they so helpful in', 'source_text' => 'Saya lebih rela memilih seseorang yang kurang cerdik dan gagal di sekolah tetapi lurus akhlaknya, menghormati kita dan sangat membantu dalam', 'order' => 750],
            ['start_time' => 2271.626, 'end_time' => 2276.216, 'target_text' => 'society, but they might not have been educated so well in terms of secular education.', 'source_text' => 'masyarakat, walaupun mereka mungkin tidak mendapat pendidikan sekular yang begitu tinggi.', 'order' => 751],
            ['start_time' => 2276.316, 'end_time' => 2276.856, 'target_text' => 'Big deal.', 'source_text' => 'Bukannya masalah besar.', 'order' => 752],
            ['start_time' => 2276.956, 'end_time' => 2277.776, 'target_text' => 'Which one would you prefer?', 'source_text' => 'Mana satu yang anda lebih suka?', 'order' => 753],
            ['start_time' => 2277.876, 'end_time' => 2280.206, 'target_text' => 'This one or that one?', 'source_text' => 'Yang ini atau yang itu?', 'order' => 754],
            ['start_time' => 2280.306, 'end_time' => 2282.216, 'target_text' => 'May Allah give us neither, actually.', 'source_text' => 'Sebenarnya, semoga Allah tidak menghadapkan kita dengan pilihan yang ekstrem sebegini.', 'order' => 755],
            ['start_time' => 2282.316, 'end_time' => 2286.576, 'target_text' => 'May we have those who are intelligent and at the same time they have How\'s that?', 'source_text' => 'Semoga kita dikurniakan generasi yang bijak dan pada masa yang sama mempunyai akhlak mulia. Bagaimana?', 'order' => 756],
            ['start_time' => 2286.676, 'end_time' => 2288.326, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a good dua, right?', 'source_text' => 'Ia doa yang bagus, bukan?', 'order' => 757],
            ['start_time' => 2288.426, 'end_time' => 2289.966, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 758],
            ['start_time' => 2290.066, 'end_time' => 2292.096, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless all of us and grant us ease and good.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati kita semua dan mengurniakan kita kemudahan serta kebaikan.', 'order' => 759],
            ['start_time' => 2292.196, 'end_time' => 2296.816, 'target_text' => 'So, while we have our struggles, the ummah is struggling, that\'s why we talk about remaining steadfast.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, tatkala kita menghadapi kesukaran dan ummah sedang bergelut, itulah sebabnya kita menekankan tentang perlunya beristiqamah.', 'order' => 760],
            ['start_time' => 2296.916, 'end_time' => 2297.736, 'target_text' => 'Try to help people.', 'source_text' => 'Cuba bantu orang lain.', 'order' => 761],
            ['start_time' => 2297.836, 'end_time' => 2299.496, 'target_text' => 'Allah will help you when you help others.', 'source_text' => 'Allah akan membantu anda apabila anda membantu orang lain.', 'order' => 762],
            ['start_time' => 2299.596, 'end_time' => 2300.656, 'target_text' => 'Have a good thought of others.', 'source_text' => 'Bersangka baiklah terhadap orang lain.', 'order' => 763],
            ['start_time' => 2300.756, 'end_time' => 2303.856, 'target_text' => 'Say good things about one another and Allah will open your doors.', 'source_text' => 'Ucapkanlah perkataan yang baik tentang satu sama lain dan Allah akan membuka pintu rezeki anda.', 'order' => 764],
            ['start_time' => 2303.956, 'end_time' => 2306.086, 'target_text' => 'And remember something.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ingatlah sesuatu.', 'order' => 765],
            ['start_time' => 2306.186, 'end_time' => 2308.806, 'target_text' => 'Here in Cape Town, especially,', 'source_text' => 'Di sini khususnya di Cape Town,', 'order' => 766],
            ['start_time' => 2308.906, 'end_time' => 2311.966, 'target_text' => 'you are blessed with a lot of schools.', 'source_text' => 'anda diberkati dengan banyak sekolah dan madrasah.', 'order' => 767],
            ['start_time' => 2312.066, 'end_time' => 2313.536, 'target_text' => 'Quran is taught in Cape Town.', 'source_text' => 'Al-Quran diajarkan di Cape Town.', 'order' => 768],
            ['start_time' => 2313.636, 'end_time' => 2315.456, 'target_text' => 'The first time I came here, I spoke about it.', 'source_text' => 'Kali pertama saya datang ke sini, saya pernah menyebut mengenainya.', 'order' => 769],
            ['start_time' => 2315.556, 'end_time' => 2317.616, 'target_text' => 'Then I\'ve spoken about it so many times.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian saya telah menyatakannya berkali-kali.', 'order' => 770],
            ['start_time' => 2317.716, 'end_time' => 2318.456, 'target_text' => 'You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda?', 'order' => 771],
            ['start_time' => 2318.556, 'end_time' => 2325.166, 'target_text' => 'Someone just says "A\'uzu billahi minashaitanir rajim." I\'ll tell you this guy\'s from Cape Town.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya mendengar seseorang melafazkan "A\'udzu billahi minasy syaithanir rajim", saya sudah boleh memberitahu bahawa dia orang Cape Town.', 'order' => 772],
            ['start_time' => 2325.266, 'end_time' => 2326.446, 'target_text' => 'I promise you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berani jamin.', 'order' => 773],
            ['start_time' => 2326.546, 'end_time' => 2330.687, 'target_text' => 'I Now, the level and standard of recital has improved throughout the world.', 'source_text' => 'Kini, tahap dan mutu bacaan telah meningkat di seluruh dunia.', 'order' => 774],
            ['start_time' => 2330.787, 'end_time' => 2332.247, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what I\'m noticing.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah yang saya perhatikan.', 'order' => 775],
            ['start_time' => 2332.347, 'end_time' => 2336.857, 'target_text' => 'But you can pick up in Cape Town, it\'s been for a long, long time.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi anda boleh mengenalinya di Cape Town, tradisi ini telah wujud sejak sekian lama.', 'order' => 776],
            ['start_time' => 2336.957, 'end_time' => 2338.457, 'target_text' => 'Can I let you in on something?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah saya berkongsi satu rahsia dengan anda?', 'order' => 777],
            ['start_time' => 2338.557, 'end_time' => 2342.537, 'target_text' => 'There was always a little like rivalry between Joburg and Cape Town back in the day.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu sentiasa ada sedikit persaingan sihat antara Joburg dan Cape Town pada masa lampau.', 'order' => 778],
            ['start_time' => 2342.637, 'end_time' => 2346.977, 'target_text' => 'And I tell you, Cape Town USED TO SEND THE HUFFADH TO JOHANNESBURG TO LEAD THE PRAYER.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya beritahu anda, CAPE TOWN PERNAH MENGHANTAR PARA HAFIZ KE JOHANNESBURG UNTUK MENGIMAMI SOLAT.', 'order' => 779],
            ['start_time' => 2347.077, 'end_time' => 2348.057, 'target_text' => 'Am I right or wrong?', 'source_text' => 'Betul atau salah kata saya?', 'order' => 780],
            ['start_time' => 2348.157, 'end_time' => 2348.657, 'target_text' => 'THERE WE GO.', 'source_text' => 'BENAR SEKALI.', 'order' => 781],
            ['start_time' => 2348.757, 'end_time' => 2350.557, 'target_text' => 'TAKBIR!', 'source_text' => 'TAKBIR!', 'order' => 782],
            ['start_time' => 2350.787, 'end_time' => 2352.057, 'target_text' => 'THOSE DAYS NEED TO COME BACK.', 'source_text' => 'ZAMAN ITU PERLU KEMBALI SEMULA.', 'order' => 783],
            ['start_time' => 2352.157, 'end_time' => 2355.217, 'target_text' => 'I\'M NOT saying we need to send our huffadh back to Joburg.', 'source_text' => 'SAYA BUKAN bermaksud kita mesti menghantar semula para hafiz kita ke Joburg.', 'order' => 784],
            ['start_time' => 2355.317, 'end_time' => 2359.377, 'target_text' => 'But I am saying we need to revive so that Cape Town can lead once again.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya katakan kita perlu bangkit kembali agar Cape Town boleh memimpin sekali lagi.', 'order' => 785],
            ['start_time' => 2359.477, 'end_time' => 2361.937, 'target_text' => 'And it is leading, but inshallah in a bigger way.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ia sememangnya sedang memimpin, namun insya-Allah dalam skala yang lebih besar.', 'order' => 786],
            ['start_time' => 2362.037, 'end_time' => 2363.097, 'target_text' => 'And we need the youngsters.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita memerlukan anak-anak muda.', 'order' => 787],
            ['start_time' => 2363.197, 'end_time' => 2363.927, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why we are here.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah kita berada di sini.', 'order' => 788],
            ['start_time' => 2364.027, 'end_time' => 2364.777, 'target_text' => 'Light upon light.', 'source_text' => 'Cahaya di atas cahaya (Light Upon Light).', 'order' => 789],
            ['start_time' => 2364.877, 'end_time' => 2369.607, 'target_text' => 'The aim of light upon light is is primarily', 'source_text' => 'Tujuan Light Upon Light ini pada dasarnya adalah', 'order' => 790],
            ['start_time' => 2369.707, 'end_time' => 2375.937, 'target_text' => 'to help the Muslim masses be proud of their Muslim identity.', 'source_text' => 'untuk membantu umat Islam berbangga dengan identiti keislaman mereka.', 'order' => 791],
            ['start_time' => 2376.037, 'end_time' => 2377.567, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the primary aim.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah tujuan utamanya.', 'order' => 792],
            ['start_time' => 2377.667, 'end_time' => 2378.927, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t want to go into other thing.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak mahu menyentuh perkara-perkara lain.', 'order' => 793],
            ['start_time' => 2379.027, 'end_time' => 2383.617, 'target_text' => 'We\'ve traveled the world and seen the war is against the identity.', 'source_text' => 'Kita telah mengembara ke serata dunia dan melihat bahawa peperangan sebenar adalah terhadap identiti.', 'order' => 794],
            ['start_time' => 2383.717, 'end_time' => 2391.047, 'target_text' => 'They want to make you embarrassed to be a Muslim, ashamed of your kufi, and ashamed of your name, and ashamed to be a Muslim,', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mahu membuatkan anda malu menjadi Muslim, malu memakai kopiah, malu dengan nama Islam anda, dan segan menjadi seorang Muslim,', 'order' => 795],
            ['start_time' => 2391.147, 'end_time' => 2393.967, 'target_text' => 'to dress as a Muslim, and to SAY I EAT HALAL.', 'source_text' => 'malu berpakaian seperti orang Islam, dan segan MENGATAKAN SAYA MAKAN MAKANAN HALAL.', 'order' => 796],
            ['start_time' => 2394.067, 'end_time' => 2397.247, 'target_text' => 'SO, WE are here to tell you, you know what?', 'source_text' => 'OLEH ITU, KAMI berada di sini untuk berpesan kepada anda, tahukah anda?', 'order' => 797],
            ['start_time' => 2397.347, 'end_time' => 2398.457, 'target_text' => 'Maintain your identity.', 'source_text' => 'Kekalkan identiti anda.', 'order' => 798],
            ['start_time' => 2398.557, 'end_time' => 2399.417, 'target_text' => 'Be a proud Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah seorang Muslim yang bangga dengan agamanya.', 'order' => 799],
            ['start_time' => 2399.517, 'end_time' => 2400.177, 'target_text' => 'Stand up.', 'source_text' => 'Bangkitlah teguh.', 'order' => 800],
            ['start_time' => 2400.277, 'end_time' => 2406.497, 'target_text' => 'And inshallah in that way, you won\'t just dissolve in the cauldron, but rather you will be a person who\'s going to contribute', 'source_text' => 'Dan insya-Allah dengan cara itu, anda bukan sekadar larut dalam kancah pengaruh luar, tetapi sebaliknya anda akan menjadi insan yang menyumbang', 'order' => 801],
            ['start_time' => 2406.597, 'end_time' => 2409.327, 'target_text' => 'for the generations to come to remain on the deen.', 'source_text' => 'agar generasi akan datang terus teguh di atas jalan agama ini.', 'order' => 802],
            ['start_time' => 2409.427, 'end_time' => 2410.847, 'target_text' => '>> Takbir!', 'source_text' => 'Takbir!', 'order' => 803],
            ['start_time' => 2410.947, 'end_time' => 2413.537, 'target_text' => '>> May Allah almighty bless us all and grant us ease and goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa memberkati kita semua dan mengurniakan kita kemudahan serta kebaikan.', 'order' => 804],
            ['start_time' => 2413.637, 'end_time' => 2414.047, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha-Allah.', 'order' => 805],
            ['start_time' => 2414.147, 'end_time' => 2415.297, 'target_text' => 'I heard a takbir from the back.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mendengar laungan takbir dari belakang.', 'order' => 806],
            ['start_time' => 2415.397, 'end_time' => 2416.647, 'target_text' => 'You know what that means?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa maksudnya?', 'order' => 807],
            ['start_time' => 2416.747, 'end_time' => 2417.737, 'target_text' => 'It means your time is up.', 'source_text' => 'Maknanya masa saya sudah tamat.', 'order' => 808],
            ['start_time' => 2417.837, 'end_time' => 2419.527, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 809],
            ['start_time' => 2419.627, 'end_time' => 2420.657, 'target_text' => 'Now, smart way, huh?', 'source_text' => 'Cara yang bijak memberi isyarat, bukan?', 'order' => 810],
            ['start_time' => 2420.757, 'end_time' => 2421.287, 'target_text' => 'But I caught it.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya sempat memahaminya.', 'order' => 811],
            ['start_time' => 2421.387, 'end_time' => 2422.937, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t worry, brother Hisham.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan risau, saudara Hisham.', 'order' => 812],
            ['start_time' => 2423.037, 'end_time' => 2423.737, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memberkati anda.', 'order' => 813],
            ['start_time' => 2423.837, 'end_time' => 2424.697, 'target_text' => 'Jazakallahu khairan.', 'source_text' => 'Jazakallahu khairan.', 'order' => 814],
            ['start_time' => 2424.797, 'end_time' => 2425.937, 'target_text' => 'Qulu qawli hadha.', 'source_text' => 'Aqulu qawli hadha.', 'order' => 815],
            ['start_time' => 2426.037, 'end_time' => 2427.857, 'target_text' => 'Wa sallallahu wa sallam ala nabiyina Muhammad.', 'source_text' => 'Wa sallallahu wa sallama \'ala nabiyyina Muhammad.', 'order' => 816],
            ['start_time' => 2427.957, 'end_time' => 2431.877, 'target_text' => 'Wa sallam alaykum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh.', 'source_text' => 'Wassalamu \'alaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuh.', 'order' => 817],
        ];

        // Bulk insert in chunks of 100 for maximum performance and atomicity
        $now = now();
        $chunks = array_chunk($subtitles, 100);
        foreach ($chunks as $chunk) {
            $insertData = [];
            foreach ($chunk as $item) {
                $insertData[] = [
                    'id'          => (string) \Illuminate\Support\Str::uuid(),
                    'video_id'    => $video->id,
                    'start_time'  => $item['start_time'],
                    'end_time'    => $item['end_time'],
                    'target_text' => $item['target_text'],
                    'source_text' => $item['source_text'],
                    'order'       => $item['order'],
                    'created_at'  => $now,
                    'updated_at'  => $now,
                ];
            }
            DB::table('video_subtitles')->insert($insertData);
        }

        // Call Special Video #2 (Tanzania 2026 - Mufti Menk) Seeder
        $this->call(SpecialVideo2Seeder::class);

